^DIC(19,19,1,0)="^19.06^5^5^2970730^^^^"
^DIC(19,19,1,1,0)="This option is used to read MailMan messages.  The user will be asked"
^DIC(19,19,1,2,0)="for a mail basket, which is normally the IN basket.  Deleted messages"
^DIC(19,19,1,3,0)="may be seen by reading the WASTE basket.  Once read, messages may be"
^DIC(19,19,1,4,0)="deleted, saved into other mail baskets, forwarded to other users, edited,"
^DIC(19,19,1,5,0)="or queried for information regarding other recipients of the message."
