^DIC(19,124,1,0)="^^4^4^2880401^^^^"
^DIC(19,124,1,1,0)="This option displays various user attributes.  If the user is currently"
^DIC(19,124,1,2,0)="signed on, it displays the job and device numbers, the sign-on time, and"
^DIC(19,124,1,3,0)="what option is being executed.  Otherwise, it displays the last sign-on"
^DIC(19,124,1,4,0)="time. It also displays which keys are held by this user."
