^DIC(19,217,1,1,0)="This option should be used to enable re-release of a Treatment Data "
^DIC(19,217,1,2,0)="entry that has been rejected by Austin.  This option merely enables the"
^DIC(19,217,1,3,0)="re-release of a Treatment Data entry.  The next time Treatment Data is"
^DIC(19,217,1,4,0)="released using the Review/Release option, this entry can be included in the"
^DIC(19,217,1,5,0)="transmission to Austin."
