^DIC(19,310,1,0)="^^3^3^2880513^"
^DIC(19,310,1,1,0)="Displays in screen format the PM schedule of a given device type (discrete"
^DIC(19,310,1,2,0)="entry in File 6911, DEVICE NAME). This is best thought of as the default"
^DIC(19,310,1,3,0)="PM schedule for all devices of the given type. No editing."
