^DIC(19,385,1,1,0)="This option is used to transfer a patient between wards, to/return from"
^DIC(19,385,1,2,0)="Authorized/Unauthorized/Authorized Absence less than 96 hours and to/"
^DIC(19,385,1,3,0)="return from Absent Sick in Hospital (ASIH).  It is also used to transfer"
^DIC(19,385,1,4,0)="a patient from Authorized Absence to Unauthorized Absence.  In the case"
^DIC(19,385,1,5,0)="of an Interward or ASIH transfer the user will also be prompted with the"
^DIC(19,385,1,6,0)="""TREATING SPECIALTY TRANSFER DATE"" prompt where s/he may transfer the"
^DIC(19,385,1,7,0)="users treating specialty and/or provider if either changed at the time"
^DIC(19,385,1,8,0)="of transfer."
