^DIC(19,521,1,2,0)="patient service transfers and discharges by their appropriate TRANSFER DRG"
^DIC(19,521,1,3,0)="or DISCHARGE DRG.   ALOS Reports for DRGs can also be run from the 'Batch"
^DIC(19,521,1,4,0)="Multilple DRG Reports' option if other DRG reports for the same time"
