^DIC(19,1165,"U")="LAB ADD TEST(S) TO AN EXISTING"
^DIC(19,1166,0)="LRCENDEL^Delete entire order or individual tests^^R^.5^^^^^^^26"
^DIC(19,1166,1,0)="^^4^4^2870203^^^"
^DIC(19,1166,1,1,0)="This option may be used to remove an entire order.  The reason for"
^DIC(19,1166,1,2,0)="deleting the order must be entered.  If results have already been"
^DIC(19,1166,1,3,0)="entered and verified for any part of the order, the order cannot be"
^DIC(19,1166,1,4,0)="deleted."
^DIC(19,1166,25)="LRCENDEL"
^DIC(19,1166,"U")="DELETE ENTIRE ORDER OR INDIVID"
^DIC(19,1177,0)="LRSTUF^Batch data entry (chem, hem, tox, etc.)^^R^.5^LRVERIFY^^^^^^26"
^DIC(19,1177,1,0)="^^5^5^2870203^^^^"
^DIC(19,1177,1,1,0)="Once the set of accessions is specified, and the test to be edited is"
^DIC(19,1177,1,2,0)="specified, the system loops through the accessions with a minimum of"
^DIC(19,1177,1,3,0)="overhead.  If the ""automatically stuff"" option is selected, and the"
^DIC(19,1177,1,4,0)="text for entry is preceded by a ""/"", the text will not be checked with"
^DIC(19,1177,1,5,0)="the input transform; e.g, ""/canceled"" may be entered for numeric fields."
^DIC(19,1177,25)="LRSTUF"
^DIC(19,1177,"U")="BATCH DATA ENTRY (CHEM, HEM, T"
