^DIC(19,1198,1,1,0)="This function allows the user to modify the list of what tests are"
^DIC(19,1198,1,2,0)="to be pulled from the accessions and be put on the load or work list."
^DIC(19,1198,1,3,0)="If tests are accessioned to the area associated with the load/work list"
^DIC(19,1198,1,4,0)="but are not on the given profile, the tests will not appear on the"
^DIC(19,1198,1,5,0)="load/work list.  If a specimen is further indicated for a given test on"
^DIC(19,1198,1,6,0)="the profile, only tests for the indicated specimen will be put on the"
^DIC(19,1198,1,7,0)="load/work list.  If no specimen is indicated, any specimen with the"
^DIC(19,1198,1,8,0)="indicated test will be placed on the load/work list."
^DIC(19,1198,30)="LRO(68.2,"
^DIC(19,1198,31)="AEMQ"
^DIC(19,1198,50)="LRO(68.2,"
^DIC(19,1198,51)="[LRLLPRO]"
^DIC(19,1198,"U")="EDIT THE LOAD/WORK LIST PROFIL"
