^DIC(19,1234,1,2,0)="no accessions are created, and only appropriate for 'SEND PATIENT'"
^DIC(19,1234,1,3,0)="type of orders.  The order number generated is used under the function"
^DIC(19,1234,1,4,0)="'Accessioning tests from ward order entry' to generate the labels"
^DIC(19,1234,1,5,0)="and indicate the specimen is in the lab."
