^DIC(19,1342,1,1,0)="Presents a report for a range of days of all isolates (with patient name,"
^DIC(19,1342,1,2,0)="address, etc.) for all organisms (fungus, AFB, parasite, etc.) that are "
^DIC(19,1342,1,3,0)="reportable to the State Health Department."
^DIC(19,1342,25)="LRMIHDR"
