^DIC(19,1376,1,1,0)="THIS OPTION PRINTS IN THE INTERIM FORMAT,  The report prints site codes for"
^DIC(19,1376,1,2,0)="tests and prints a separate page(s) at the end of the report which lists the"
^DIC(19,1376,1,3,0)="performing lab name, address and site code."
^DIC(19,1376,1,4,0)="This option will print interim reports for a selected patient within a given "
^DIC(19,1376,1,5,0)="time period.  The printout will go inverse date order.  This report will output"
^DIC(19,1376,1,6,0)="all tests for the time period specified.  This option will only print verified"
^DIC(19,1376,1,7,0)="results."
^DIC(19,1376,25)="CUM^LRRP2"
^DIC(19,1376,"U")="PATIENT LAB DISCHARGE SUMMARY "
