^DIC(19,1677,1,2,0)="is usually not accessed directly.  If the user answers 'yes' to "
^DIC(19,1677,1,3,0)="the batching of reports prompt of the 'Report Enter/Edit' option,"
^DIC(19,1677,1,4,0)="then this option is performed."
