^DIC(19,1699,1,1,0)="This option allows the supervisor to generate a list of"
^DIC(19,1699,1,2,0)="all exams that have not been completed.  This report is similar to the"
^DIC(19,1699,1,3,0)="'Delinquent Status' report, but unlike that report, this one lists any"
^DIC(19,1699,1,4,0)="exam that is not in the 'complete' status."
