^DIC(19,1773,1,1,0)="This function permits users with Requestor privileges to enter the"
^DIC(19,1773,1,2,0)="information necessary for a 2237, 1358 and other requests."
^DIC(19,1773,1,3,0)="The request is then available for review by the designated clerk.  If the"
^DIC(19,1773,1,4,0)="clerk decides to change it to a 2237 it may then be passed to the Control "
