^DIC(19,2188,1,0)="^19.06^9^9^3021031^^^^"
^DIC(19,2188,1,1,0)="This option reports all verified results for one day for one provider."
^DIC(19,2188,1,2,0)="The user will request the date and provider.  This option will only"
^DIC(19,2188,1,3,0)="print verified results.  The date requested should be the date the"
^DIC(19,2188,1,4,0)="lab work was collected.  This option is to be used for information only"
^DIC(19,2188,1,5,0)="and should not be charted."
^DIC(19,2188,1,6,0)="The report prints site codes for tests.  You will be asked if you would"
