^DIC(19,2653,1,1,0)="This option allows the user to enter and edit data in the TRANSMISSION"
^DIC(19,2653,1,2,0)="ROUTERS File (#407.7).  This should be used to enter/edit receiving users"
^DIC(19,2653,1,3,0)="and their mail router domain for transmission of OPC, PTF, and"
^DIC(19,2653,1,4,0)="RUG II data.  To enable transmission to the selected receiving user, the"
^DIC(19,2653,1,5,0)="TRANSMIT field must be set to Yes."
^DIC(19,2653,25)="VATREDIT"
^DIC(19,2653,"U")="ENTER/EDIT TRANSMISSION ROUTER"
