^DIC(19,2665,1,1,0)="This option allows the user to perform final review of "
^DIC(19,2665,1,2,0)="information contained in a billing record. The user is"
^DIC(19,2665,1,3,0)="then able to authorize the generation of the bill and"
^DIC(19,2665,1,4,0)="the release of the information to Fiscal."
