^DIC(19,3127,1,1,0)="This option allows the user the enter transactions into the Patient"
^DIC(19,3127,1,2,0)="Funds system where most of the information is duplicated from transaction"
^DIC(19,3127,1,3,0)="to transaction.  The option ""reads"" the duplicate information into"
^DIC(19,3127,1,4,0)="a temporary file.  Individual data for each patient is entered and when"
^DIC(19,3127,1,5,0)="verified, is matched with the duplicate data and posted to the master"
^DIC(19,3127,1,6,0)="file."
