^DIC(19,3169,0)="DGBT BENE TRAVEL SCREEN^Claim Enter/Edit^Option is no longer available. Please use appropriate claim processing system.^R^10000000020^^^^^^^546"
^DIC(19,3169,1,0)="^^8^8^2930614^"
^DIC(19,3169,1,1,0)="This is the enter/edit option for Beneficiary Travel Claims."
^DIC(19,3169,1,2,0)="Two informational screens are displayed prior to entering/editing"
^DIC(19,3169,1,3,0)="claim information.  Based on the information on these screens,"
^DIC(19,3169,1,4,0)="the Beneficiary Travel Clerk should be able to determine the"
^DIC(19,3169,1,5,0)="beneficiary's entitlement for travel reimbursement.  This option"
^DIC(19,3169,1,6,0)="will determine whether the deductible should be applied and how much"
^DIC(19,3169,1,7,0)="the deductible and amount payable should be based on the information"
^DIC(19,3169,1,8,0)="entered."
^DIC(19,3169,25)="DGBTE"
^DIC(19,3169,99)="55761,55967"
^DIC(19,3169,"U")="CLAIM ENTER/EDIT"
^DIC(19,3170,0)="DGBT BENE TRAVEL REPORT^Report of Claim Amounts^^R^10000000020^^^^^^^546^^"
^DIC(19,3170,1,0)="^^9^9^2930420^^^^"
^DIC(19,3170,1,1,0)="This option can be used to print a wide variety of statistical reports."
^DIC(19,3170,1,2,0)="They can be sorted by Patient, Account, Carrier or Account Type."
^DIC(19,3170,1,3,0)="It generates a listing of totals for Beneficiary Travel for a "
^DIC(19,3170,1,4,0)="specified date range.  The report will be broken down by divisions"
^DIC(19,3170,1,5,0)="and each division will be further broken down by Account,"
^DIC(19,3170,1,6,0)="Patient, or Carrier (vendor).  Each of these reports will supply"
^DIC(19,3170,1,7,0)="individual totals as well as division and grand totals.  A choice"
^DIC(19,3170,1,8,0)="of displaying the full report (all necessary information) or just"
^DIC(19,3170,1,9,0)="totals can be made by the user."
^DIC(19,3170,20)=""
^DIC(19,3170,25)="START^DGBTOA5"
^DIC(19,3170,"U")="REPORT OF CLAIM AMOUNTS"
^DIC(19,3171,0)="DGBT BENE TRAVEL CERTIFICATION^Income Certification Eligibility^Option is no longer available. Please use BTSSS.^R^10000000020^^^^^^^546"
^DIC(19,3171,1,0)="^19.06^5^5^3031113^^^^"
^DIC(19,3171,1,1,0)="This option is used to enter/edit income certification information.  "
^DIC(19,3171,1,2,0)="It allows for the entering and editing of DATE CERTIFIED, ELIGIBLE,"
^DIC(19,3171,1,3,0)="and AMOUNT CERTIFIED (the previous year's income as reported by the "
^DIC(19,3171,1,4,0)="patient).  This income information is usually done annually and"
^DIC(19,3171,1,5,0)="does not replace full certification."
^DIC(19,3171,25)="CERT^DGBTEF"
^DIC(19,3171,"U")="INCOME CERTIFICATION ELIGIBILI"
^DIC(19,3173,0)="DGBT BENE TRAVEL VIEW^View of Claim^^R^10000000020^^^^^^^546"
^DIC(19,3173,1,0)="^^3^3^2901022^^^^"
^DIC(19,3173,1,1,0)="This option allows the user to view a previously entered Beneficiary "
^DIC(19,3173,1,2,0)="Travel Claim for a specific patient and claim date.  "
^DIC(19,3173,1,3,0)="No entering or editing of claims will take place under this option.  "
^DIC(19,3173,25)="DISPLAY^DGBTR"
^DIC(19,3173,"U")="VIEW OF CLAIM"
^DIC(19,3174,0)="DGBT BENE TRAVEL REPRINT^Reprint of 70-3542d form^Option is no longer available. Please use BTSSS.^R^10000000020^^^^^^^546"
^DIC(19,3174,1,0)="^^2^2^2890531^^^^"
^DIC(19,3174,1,1,0)="This option can be used to reprint the Beneficiary Travel form (70-3542d),"
^DIC(19,3174,1,2,0)="""Voucher for Cash Reimbursement of Beneficiary Travel Expenses""."
^DIC(19,3174,25)="REPRINT^DGBTR"
^DIC(19,3174,"U")="REPRINT OF 70-3542D FORM"
^DIC(19,3175,0)="DG RELIGION LIST^Religion List for Inpatients^^R^.5^^^^^^^114"
^DIC(19,3175,1,0)="^^6^6^2890302^^"
^DIC(19,3175,1,1,0)="Lists the inpatients and their religious affiliations. The reports major"
^DIC(19,3175,1,2,0)="sort is by division with a choice of displaying by either religion or ward"
^DIC(19,3175,1,3,0)="location. A current inpatient listing of those patients that are in "
^DIC(19,3175,1,4,0)="hospital today or a listing of patients that were admitted to the hospital "
^DIC(19,3175,1,5,0)="for a specific date range may be displayed. The final printout will"
^DIC(19,3175,1,6,0)="display room/bed, SSN and admission date/time."
^DIC(19,3175,25)="DGOREL"
^DIC(19,3175,31)=""
^DIC(19,3175,32)=""
^DIC(19,3175,"U")="RELIGION LIST FOR INPATIENTS"
^DIC(19,3176,0)="DG INSURANCE LIST^Insurance List of UNKNOWNs for Inpatients^^R^.5^^^^^^^114"
^DIC(19,3176,1,0)="^^9^9^2890320^^^^"
^DIC(19,3176,1,1,0)="Lists the inpatients who have ""Unknown"" in their insurance file or have"
^DIC(19,3176,1,2,0)="left that question unanswered. The major sort is by division with a "
^DIC(19,3176,1,3,0)="choice of a current listing, those patients who are currently inpatients"
^DIC(19,3176,1,4,0)="or those patients admitted for a specified date range."
^DIC(19,3176,1,5,0)="SSN, DOB, VET status, service connection and admission date/time are all"
^DIC(19,3176,1,6,0)="displayed. Totals are also displayed for each division, showing the number"
^DIC(19,3176,1,7,0)="of ""Unknowns"" and the number who have not answered that question."
^DIC(19,3176,1,8,0)="A final total page shows the breakdown of each division and the final"
^DIC(19,3176,1,9,0)="Medical Center totals."
^DIC(19,3176,25)="DGOINS"
^DIC(19,3176,"U")="INSURANCE LIST OF UNKNOWNS FOR"
^DIC(19,3177,0)="DG PTF BACKGROUND JOB^PTF Background Job^^R^.5^^^^^^^114"
^DIC(19,3177,1,0)="^^2^2^2930504^^^"
^DIC(19,3177,1,1,0)="Update to run nightly to update length of stay in PTF record for active admission"
^DIC(19,3177,1,2,0)="records and to update means test indicator in PTF in Open PTF records."
^DIC(19,3177,25)="ACTIVE^DGPTFUP"
^DIC(19,3177,200)="^^^"
^DIC(19,3177,"U")="PTF BACKGROUND JOB"
^DIC(19,3178,0)="DG INPATIENT ROSTER^Inpatient Roster^^R^.5^^^^^^^114"
^DIC(19,3178,1,0)="3^^6^6^2921125^"
^DIC(19,3178,1,1,0)="The Inpatient Roster report will provide a listing of patients "
^DIC(19,3178,1,2,0)="sorted/selected by either Ward or Provider.  The report contains "
^DIC(19,3178,1,3,0)="Name, Id, Age, Admission Date, LOS, Ward, Room-Bed, Primary "
^DIC(19,3178,1,4,0)="Physician, Attending Physician, Treating Specialty, and Means Test "
^DIC(19,3178,1,5,0)="Status."
^DIC(19,3178,1,6,0)="It will also allow you to specify the number of copies to print."
^DIC(19,3178,25)="DGOINPT"
^DIC(19,3178,"U")="INPATIENT ROSTER"
^DIC(19,3179,0)="DG PTF DRG INFORMATION OUTPUT^DRG Information Report^^A^.5^^^^^^^114^^1"
^DIC(19,3179,1,0)="^^2^2^2890419^"
^DIC(19,3179,1,1,0)="This option generates an output which shows the DRGs that the user"
^DIC(19,3179,1,2,0)="selected diagnosis codes fall into with each of the codes as the DXLS."
^DIC(19,3179,20)="S DGPTODR=1 D ^DGPTDRG"
^DIC(19,3179,"U")="DRG INFORMATION REPORT"
^DIC(19,3180,0)="SDPRLETTERS^Print Scheduling Letters^^R^.5^^^^^^^16^^^1"
^DIC(19,3180,1,0)="^^7^7^2900419^^^^"
^DIC(19,3180,1,1,0)="     This option will allow you to print any type of scheduling "
^DIC(19,3180,1,2,0)="letter. You may choose not to print letters that are assigned to"
^DIC(19,3180,1,3,0)="the clinics. If you do not print letters that are assigned to the"
^DIC(19,3180,1,4,0)="clinics, the letter selected will print for all patients."
^DIC(19,3180,1,5,0)="If you select to print letters assigned to the clinics and the selected "
^DIC(19,3180,1,6,0)="clinics do not have letters of the corresponding type assigned to them,"
^DIC(19,3180,1,7,0)="no letters for those clinics will print."
^DIC(19,3180,15)="K P,SDAP,SDINP,SDOK,SDPT,SDV2"
^DIC(19,3180,25)="SDLTP"
^DIC(19,3180,99)="55707,27357"
