^DIC(19,3782,1,0)="^^6^6^2880513^^^^"
^DIC(19,3782,1,1,0)="This option will print or display interim reports for a selected"
^DIC(19,3782,1,2,0)="patient, within a given time period.  The printout will go in inverse"
^DIC(19,3782,1,3,0)="date order.  This report will output all tests for the time period"
^DIC(19,3782,1,4,0)="specified.  If no results are available, the option will ask for"
^DIC(19,3782,1,5,0)="another patient.  This option will only print verified results and"
^DIC(19,3782,1,6,0)="at present does not output the microbiology reports."
