^DIC(19,4178,1,1,0)="Program loops through all transactions for a selected control point."
^DIC(19,4178,1,2,0)="For each transaction read, program checks whether P.O. has been entered,"
^DIC(19,4178,1,3,0)="and the date received has not yet been entered.  It then checks the"
^DIC(19,4178,1,4,0)="partials.  If the final partial has been received, or the P.O. is"
^DIC(19,4178,1,5,0)="either a Certified Invoice, Direct Delivery or Payment in Advance,"
^DIC(19,4178,1,6,0)="the user is allowed to enter the Date Received by the Service."
