^DIC(19,4568,"U")="UNRELEASED CENSUS RECORDS REPO"
^DIC(19,4569,0)="DGPT CENSUS RELEASE RECORD^Release Closed Census Records^^R^.5^DG PTFREL^^^^^^114"
