^DIC(19,5141,1,1,0)="This option allows any option that is in the Option file with the"
^DIC(19,5141,1,2,0)="SCHEDULING RECOMMENDED field set to yes, to be set up for one-time"
^DIC(19,5141,1,3,0)="queuing."
