^DIC(19,5355,1,0)="^^4^4^2900914^^^"
^DIC(19,5355,1,1,0)="This function allows the user to set the selected instrument to be run"
^DIC(19,5355,1,2,0)="on the basis of accession numbers.  That is, the data transmitted from"
^DIC(19,5355,1,3,0)="the automated instrument contains the accession number which allows the"
^DIC(19,5355,1,4,0)="host computer to find who or what the data belongs to."
