^DIC(19,5403,0)="LRAPRS^Supplementary report release, anat path^^R^10000000020^^^^^^^26"
^DIC(19,5403,1,0)="^^12^12^3080423^"
^DIC(19,5403,1,1,0)="Releases supplementary reports for Surgical Pathology, Cytopathology,"
^DIC(19,5403,1,2,0)="Electron Microscopy, or Autopsy.  If all supplementary reports that exist"
^DIC(19,5403,1,3,0)="for the chosen accession have already been released or if no supplementary"
^DIC(19,5403,1,4,0)="reports exist for the accession, the user will be notified.  If "
^DIC(19,5403,1,5,0)="electronic signature is not activated, the user is asked if the report is "
^DIC(19,5403,1,6,0)="to be released, yes or no.  If electronic signature has been activated, "
^DIC(19,5403,1,7,0)="the option is used to sign and store the supplementary report.  Action"
^DIC(19,5403,1,8,0)="alerts are sent automatically to the ordering provider and the primary"
^DIC(19,5403,1,9,0)="physician or PCP at the time the supplementary reports are released.  If"
^DIC(19,5403,1,10,0)="requested, alerts may be sent to additional person(s) and/or mail"
^DIC(19,5403,1,11,0)="group(s).  These additional alerts are also action alerts.  These alerts"
^DIC(19,5403,1,12,0)="are sent whether electronic signature is on or off."
^DIC(19,5403,3.91,0)="^19.391"
^DIC(19,5403,25)="EN^LRAPR"
^DIC(19,5403,"U")="SUPPLEMENTARY REPORT RELEASE, "
