^DIC(19,5510,1,7,0)=" "
^DIC(19,5510,1,8,0)=" 3. A 132 column report which combines Status/Bed section information with"
^DIC(19,5510,1,9,0)="    Budgeted FTEE and staff assignment information.  This report and the 80"
^DIC(19,5510,1,10,0)="    column Status/Bed section report reflect any discrepancies in the old/"
^DIC(19,5510,1,11,0)="    new bedsection assignments."
