^DIC(19,5538,1,0)="^^6^6^2950719^^^^"
^DIC(19,5538,1,1,0)="This option checks the status of the manhours, and NURSING Package"
^DIC(19,5538,1,2,0)="batch jobs to see if they completed."
^DIC(19,5538,1,3,0)="If these jobs do not run to completion on a specific date or"
^DIC(19,5538,1,4,0)="shift, a mail bulletin is sent to the NURS-ADP mail group.  This job should"
^DIC(19,5538,1,5,0)="be queued to run at least 2 hours after the NURAAM-ACU option runs and run "
^DIC(19,5538,1,6,0)="with a rescheduling frequency of 1D."
