^DIC(19,5608,0)="PRCT COMMENT ALIGNMENT^Comment Alignment^^R^11740^^^^^^^"
^DIC(19,5608,1,0)="^^13^13^2891108^^"
^DIC(19,5608,1,1,0)="This option will allow the alignment of comments in a barcode program."
^DIC(19,5608,1,2,0)="Comments can also be aligned by using the FileMan programmer 'Y' option"
^DIC(19,5608,1,3,0)="during the edit function.  By executing the following code, comments"
^DIC(19,5608,1,4,0)="can be aligned at any column for a range of lines:"
^DIC(19,5608,1,5,0)="                  S Y=[column] D CON^PRCTBAR"
^DIC(19,5608,1,6,0)="For example:"
^DIC(19,5608,1,7,0)=" "
^DIC(19,5608,1,8,0)="While editing you barcode program, you decide you want your comments"
^DIC(19,5608,1,9,0)="aligned at the 28th column for lines 20-40.  At the 'EDIT Option:' prompt,"
^DIC(19,5608,1,10,0)="enter a 'Y'.  You would then enter 'S Y=28 D CON^PRCTBAR'.  FileMan"
^DIC(19,5608,1,11,0)="will then ask you the range of lines you want to process.  By enter"
^DIC(19,5608,1,12,0)="the range from 20 thru 40, those lines will have comments aligned to the"
^DIC(19,5608,1,13,0)="28 column."
^DIC(19,5608,25)="COM^PRCTBAR"
^DIC(19,5608,"U")="COMMENT ALIGNMENT"
^DIC(19,5609,0)="PRCT DOWNLOAD BARCODE PROGRAM^Download Barcode Program^^R^11740^^^^^^^"
