^DIC(19,5660,1,1,0)="This menu contains options that allow the user to send special"
^DIC(19,5660,1,2,0)="transactions to Austin, such as 099's and 150's. There are also options to"
^DIC(19,5660,1,3,0)="delete PTF's and establish PTF's for an existing admission. An option to"
^DIC(19,5660,1,4,0)="modify the effective date and active/inactive flag of a facility suffix is"
