^DIC(19,6418,0)="ENWOREP^Reprint Work Orders (All Shops)^^R^.5^^^^^^^"
^DIC(19,6418,1,0)="^^5^5^2900816^"
^DIC(19,6418,1,1,0)="Reprints work orders entered within a user selected date range. The"
^DIC(19,6418,1,2,0)="'date portion' of the Work Order Number is used to determine when"
^DIC(19,6418,1,3,0)="work orders are entered. Work orders from all shops will be included."
^DIC(19,6418,1,4,0)="The intent of the option is to give users a means of batch printing"
^DIC(19,6418,1,5,0)="at the end of each day all work orders entered during the day."
