^DIC(19,6421,0)="ENPMRDEFRL^Rapid Deferral of PM Worklist^^R^.5^^^^^^^"
^DIC(19,6421,1,0)="^^11^11^2910125^^"
^DIC(19,6421,1,1,0)="Defers all entries on a user specified PM worklist. All work orders on"
^DIC(19,6421,1,2,0)="subject worklist are given a PM Status of DEFERRED and a close out date"
^DIC(19,6421,1,3,0)="of TODAY. Time and Materials are not posted. This option is intended to"
^DIC(19,6421,1,4,0)="be run only if you want to post DEFERRAL's of all open line items (PM"
^DIC(19,6421,1,5,0)="work orders) on subject worklist to Equipment Histories."
^DIC(19,6421,1,6,0)=" "
^DIC(19,6421,1,7,0)="This option is not intended for use in cases where there is some"
^DIC(19,6421,1,8,0)="expectation that you may wish to otherwise close-out the PM worklist"
^DIC(19,6421,1,9,0)="in question at some later date. That is to say, once a scheduled"
^DIC(19,6421,1,10,0)="preventive maintenance inspection task has been recorded as DEFERRED"
^DIC(19,6421,1,11,0)="it will be difficult to change it to PASSED."
^DIC(19,6421,25)="ENEQPMR6"
