^DIC(19,6763,1,2,0)="drugs and their associated Green Sheet from another NAOU.  The transferring"
^DIC(19,6763,1,3,0)="of Controlled Substances drugs between NAOUs requires two processing steps."
^DIC(19,6763,1,4,0)="  "
^DIC(19,6763,1,5,0)=" Step 1 - Transfer Green Sheet and Drug to another NAOU"
^DIC(19,6763,1,6,0)=" Step 2 - From an NAOU - Receive Green Sheet Transfer & Drug"
