^DIC(19,6941,1,1,0)="This is a menu option which manages or directs users to options adding or"
^DIC(19,6941,1,2,0)="removing notifications to those they will receive.  Users access this"
^DIC(19,6941,1,3,0)="option to turn on or off notifications.  Users may review the notifications "
^DIC(19,6941,1,4,0)="they should be currently receiving.  A user may also remove all of his/her"
^DIC(19,6941,1,5,0)="existing notifications via a purge option."
