^DIC(19,7173,1,2,0)="file that have a status of 'Pending Transmission' or 'Awaiting"
^DIC(19,7173,1,3,0)="Acknowledgement'.  The user is prompted for the date range for the report."
^DIC(19,7173,25)="PLPT^HLUOPT"
