^DIC(19,7293,1,0)="^^4^4^2901204^"
^DIC(19,7293,1,1,0)="This option is used to print the Report of Delay Reasons.  This report will"
^DIC(19,7293,1,2,0)="display the total number of times each reason was used for the date range"
^DIC(19,7293,1,3,0)="selected.  It can be sorted by surgical specialty or displayed for an"
^DIC(19,7293,1,4,0)="individual surgical specialty."
