^DIC(19,7368,1,1,0)="This is the background job that will run nightly, after"
^DIC(19,7368,1,2,0)="midnight, which will update all admissions for the "
^DIC(19,7368,1,3,0)="previous day, by creating an IRT entry for all the"
^DIC(19,7368,1,4,0)="standard deficiencies for the facility."
