^DIC(19,7612,1,1,0)="This option prints the HBPC Episode of Care/Length of Stay Report.  The"
^DIC(19,7612,1,2,0)="user is prompted to enter the date range for inclusion on the report."
^DIC(19,7612,1,3,0)="The report is sorted by patient and includes:  Patient Name, Last Four,"
^DIC(19,7612,1,4,0)="Admission Date, Discharge Date, and Length of Stay.  Report prints in"
^DIC(19,7612,1,5,0)="80 columm format."
