^DIC(19,7783,0)="FBCH ANCILLARY REIMBURSEMENT^Patient Reimbursement for Ancillary Services^^R^1^FBAA LEVEL 1 PMT DISABLE^^^^^^^^"
^DIC(19,7783,1,0)="^19.06^2^2^3260320^^^"
^DIC(19,7783,1,1,0)="This option is used to reimburse a patient for ancillary services"
^DIC(19,7783,1,2,0)="paid for by the patient.  "
^DIC(19,7783,20)=""
^DIC(19,7783,25)="PRBT^FBCHCO"
^DIC(19,7783,"U")="PATIENT REIMBURSEMENT FOR ANCI"
^DIC(19,7784,0)="FB PCR^Potential Cost Recovery Report^^R^1^^^^^^^^^1^1"
^DIC(19,7784,1,0)="44^19.06^62^62^3021118^^^^"
^DIC(19,7784,1,1,0)="This option is intended to identify costs for fee services which may be"
^DIC(19,7784,1,2,0)="able to be recovered."
^DIC(19,7784,1,3,0)="  "
^DIC(19,7784,1,4,0)="The user selects the primary service facility(s) and date range.  All"
^DIC(19,7784,1,5,0)="active fee programs are reviewed for the selected search criteria. "
^DIC(19,7784,1,6,0)="The data is sorted by division, patient, fee program, and vendor and date."
^DIC(19,7784,1,7,0)="The data displayed/printed is similar to the payment outputs, only for"
^DIC(19,7784,1,8,0)="patients that are means test category C/agree to pay deductible or"
^DIC(19,7784,1,9,0)="not exempt from LTC copay or for non-service connected treatment."
^DIC(19,7784,1,10,0)="Insurance information is also displayed/printed."
^DIC(19,7784,1,11,0)="The user is able to filter data to include Copays or Insurance only"
^DIC(19,7784,1,12,0)="related information using prompt:"
^DIC(19,7784,1,13,0)="   "
^DIC(19,7784,1,14,0)="   Include (P)atient Co-pays / (I)nsurance / (B)oth"
^DIC(19,7784,1,15,0)="   "
^DIC(19,7784,1,16,0)="If the user selects (P) or (B),the following propmpt will allow "
^DIC(19,7784,1,17,0)="the user to include Mean Test or LTC copays only or Both:"
^DIC(19,7784,1,18,0)="   "
^DIC(19,7784,1,19,0)="   Include (M)eans Test Co-pays /(L)TC Co-pays /(B)oth"
^DIC(19,7784,1,20,0)="  "
^DIC(19,7784,1,21,0)="Since July 5,2002 all LTC related payments are flagged in the report with an"
^DIC(19,7784,1,22,0)="appropriate message. If the veteran doesn't have LTC test on file then"
^DIC(19,7784,1,23,0)="the LTC related payment is flagged with ""1010EC missing"" message."
^DIC(19,7784,1,24,0)="  "
^DIC(19,7784,1,25,0)=" Outpatient program (FBPCR2) - uses date finalized for date range sort."
^DIC(19,7784,1,26,0)="   o  For each service on a treatment date, the value of the "
^DIC(19,7784,1,27,0)="      SERVICE CONNECTED Y/N field is checked.  If set to no, then"
^DIC(19,7784,1,28,0)="      software uses IB call to determine if patient is insured on "
^DIC(19,7784,1,29,0)="      treatment date"
^DIC(19,7784,1,30,0)="   o  Check is also made if patient was Cat C and agreed to pay deductible"
^DIC(19,7784,1,31,0)="      or was not exempt from LTC copay on INITIAL TREATMENT DATE.  If true,"
^DIC(19,7784,1,32,0)="      flag to collect from patient is set."
^DIC(19,7784,1,33,0)="   o  If service is for C&P, or both of the above two flags are negative,"
^DIC(19,7784,1,34,0)="      the record is bypassed."
^DIC(19,7784,1,35,0)="  "
^DIC(19,7784,1,36,0)=" Pharmacy program (FBPCR3) - uses date certified for payment for date range"
^DIC(19,7784,1,37,0)="                              sort."
^DIC(19,7784,1,38,0)="   o  For each invoice number, RX number for a patient within the specified"
^DIC(19,7784,1,39,0)="      date range, the value of the DATE PRESCRIPTION FILLED field is obtained"
^DIC(19,7784,1,40,0)="      and checked against the authorization in the FEE BASIS PATIENT file."
^DIC(19,7784,1,41,0)="      A check is made to see if the value of the POTENTIAL COST RECOVERY"
^DIC(19,7784,1,42,0)="      field is yes for an authorization which encompasses the RX FILL DATE."
^DIC(19,7784,1,43,0)="      If yes, then software uses IB call to determine if patient"
^DIC(19,7784,1,44,0)="      is insured on date certified for payment."
^DIC(19,7784,1,45,0)="   o  Check is also made if patient was Cat C and agreed to pay deductible"
^DIC(19,7784,1,46,0)="      on DATE PRESCRIPTION FILLED and agreed to pay deductible."
^DIC(19,7784,1,47,0)="      If true, flag to collect from patient is set."
^DIC(19,7784,1,48,0)="   o  If both of the above two flags are negative, record is bypassed."
^DIC(19,7784,1,49,0)="  "
^DIC(19,7784,1,50,0)=" CH/CNH program (FBPCR67*) - uses date finalized for date range sort"
^DIC(19,7784,1,51,0)="   o  For each record, for a patient within the specified date range,"
^DIC(19,7784,1,52,0)="      the value of the TREATMENT FROM date is obtained and checked"
^DIC(19,7784,1,53,0)="      against the authorization in the FEE BASIS PATIENT file."
^DIC(19,7784,1,54,0)="      A check is made to see if the value of the POTENTIAL COST RECOVERY"
^DIC(19,7784,1,55,0)="      field is set to yes for an authorization which encompasses the"
^DIC(19,7784,1,56,0)="      TREATMENT FROM DATE.  If yes, then software uses IB call to determine"
^DIC(19,7784,1,57,0)="      if patient is insured on FROM/TO dates."
^DIC(19,7784,1,58,0)="   o  Check is also made if patient was Cat C and agreed to pay deductible"
^DIC(19,7784,1,59,0)="      or was not exempt from LTC copay on TREATMENT FROM DATE or"
^DIC(19,7784,1,60,0)="      TREATMENT TO DATE. If true on at least one of those dates,"
^DIC(19,7784,1,61,0)="      flag to collect from patient is set."
^DIC(19,7784,1,62,0)="   o  If both of the above two flags are negative, record is bypassed."
^DIC(19,7784,2)="y"
^DIC(19,7784,15)="K FBSSNRF"
^DIC(19,7784,20)="S FBSSNRF=1"
^DIC(19,7784,25)="FBPCR"
^DIC(19,7784,99)="55612,50918"
^DIC(19,7784,"U")="POTENTIAL COST RECOVERY REPORT"
^DIC(19,7785,0)="FBCH COST REPORT^Cost Report for Civil Hospital^^R^1^FBCH DISABLE 2^^^^^^344^^1"
