^DIC(19,7809,0)="FBUC BATCH PRINT LETTERS^Batch Print Letters^^R^1^FBAA LEVEL 1 AUTH^^^^^^"
^DIC(19,7809,1,0)="^^7^7^2930409^"
^DIC(19,7809,1,1,0)="This option will batch print letters which have been flagged for printing,"
^DIC(19,7809,1,2,0)="but for some reason could not be printed.  A site parameter exists"
^DIC(19,7809,1,3,0)="for an output device for your letters.  If you have not filled this, or"
^DIC(19,7809,1,4,0)="if this parameter contains an invalid device, and you have indicated"
^DIC(19,7809,1,5,0)="that your letters will be either automatically or batch printed, you"
^DIC(19,7809,1,6,0)="can print your pending letters using this option."
