^DIC(19,7847,1,1,0)="This option searches all FOLLOW-UP Multiples (#400) on the "
^DIC(19,7847,1,2,0)="ONCOLOGY PATIENT File (#160) looking for expired patients.  "
^DIC(19,7847,1,3,0)="It then makes sure that the NEXT FOLLOW-UP METHOD Sub-field "
^DIC(19,7847,1,4,0)="(#6) is set to ""9"" (not followed)."
