^DIC(19,8148,1,2,0)="and copied to a new internal entry number location.  The Open a Closed"
^DIC(19,8148,1,3,0)="Offense Report option also allows the VA Police Officer to print/edit"
^DIC(19,8148,1,4,0)="the Offense Report after it has been reopened."
