^DIC(19,8496,"U")="CREATE PROBLEM SELECTION LISTS"
^DIC(19,8497,0)="GMPL ASSIGN LIST^Assign/Remove Problem Selection List^^R^11720^^^^^^^402^^"
^DIC(19,8497,1,0)="^^10^10^3170209^"
^DIC(19,8497,1,1,0)="This option allows a selection list to be assigned to user(s) as his/her"
^DIC(19,8497,1,2,0)="preferred menu of problems to select from and/or to a clinic location as "
^DIC(19,8497,1,3,0)="its default list. A user's assignment will override a clinic assignment."
^DIC(19,8497,1,4,0)=" "
^DIC(19,8497,1,5,0)="If a list is specified for the user in the Default Problem Selection List "
^DIC(19,8497,1,6,0)="Display [ORQQPL SELECTION LIST] parameter, then the Add New Problem(s)"
^DIC(19,8497,1,7,0)="option will present this list of problems to select from. If there are no "
^DIC(19,8497,1,8,0)="user defined lists, then a default clinic list will be presented."
^DIC(19,8497,1,9,0)="Searching the Lexicon Utility for a problem not on this list is always an"
^DIC(19,8497,1,10,0)="option from these menus as well."
^DIC(19,8497,20)=""
^DIC(19,8497,25)="ASSIGN^GMPLBLD2"
^DIC(19,8497,"U")="ASSIGN/REMOVE PROBLEM SELECTIO"
^DIC(19,8498,0)="GMPL BUILD ENC FORM LIST^Copy Selection List from IB Encounter Form^This option has been disabled due to the Problem List SNOMED CT implementation.^R^.5^^^^^^^402"
^DIC(19,8498,1,0)="^^6^6^2940125^^"
^DIC(19,8498,1,1,0)="This option will allow creating a new selection list by copying a list"
^DIC(19,8498,1,2,0)="already created through the Encounter Form utility (Integrated Billing"
^DIC(19,8498,1,3,0)="package) into a new entry in file #125.  This list will then be available"
^DIC(19,8498,1,4,0)="for editing further (only the new list will be altered - the list saved"
^DIC(19,8498,1,5,0)="in the Integrated Billing pkg with the form will not be changed here),"
^DIC(19,8498,1,6,0)="or for use to select from when entering new problems to a patient's list."
^DIC(19,8498,25)="GMPLBLDF"
^DIC(19,8498,"U")="COPY SELECTION LIST FROM IB EN"
^DIC(19,8499,0)="GMPL CODE LIST^Assign ICD Diagnoses to Problem List^This option is obsolete and disabled.^R^.5^^^^^^^402"
^DIC(19,8499,1,0)="^^5^5^2940203^^^"
^DIC(19,8499,1,1,0)="This option allows access to a patient's problem list to add, review,"
^DIC(19,8499,1,2,0)="or edit the ICD Code assigned to each problem.  A detailed display of"
^DIC(19,8499,1,3,0)="problem data is available, as well as searching capability into both"
^DIC(19,8499,1,4,0)="the ICD Diagnosis file and the Clinical Lexicon Utility to facilitate"
^DIC(19,8499,1,5,0)="the coding process."
^DIC(19,8499,25)="EN^GMPLCODE"
^DIC(19,8499,"U")="ASSIGN ICD DIAGNOSES TO PROBLE"
^DIC(19,8500,0)="GMPL DELETE LIST^Delete Problem Selection List^^R^.5^^^^^^^402"
^DIC(19,8500,1,0)="^^4^4^2940126^"
^DIC(19,8500,1,1,0)="This option will allow the user to delete a problem selection list and"
^DIC(19,8500,1,2,0)="its contents that is no longer in use.  Once a list is selected, the"
^DIC(19,8500,1,3,0)="New Person file, ""Problem Selection List"" field, for pointers to the"
^DIC(19,8500,1,4,0)="chosen list; if any users are found, deleting the list is not permitted."
^DIC(19,8500,25)="DELETE^GMPLBLD3"
^DIC(19,8500,"U")="DELETE PROBLEM SELECTION LIST"
^DIC(19,8501,0)="GMPL REPLACE PROBLEMS^Replace Removed Problem(s) on Patient's List^^R^.5^^^^^^^402"
^DIC(19,8501,1,0)="^^3^3^2940203^"
^DIC(19,8501,1,1,0)="This option will allow the user to list all of the problems that have"
^DIC(19,8501,1,2,0)="been removed from a selected patient's problem list, and optionally"
^DIC(19,8501,1,3,0)="place any of them back on the problem list."
^DIC(19,8501,25)="EN^GMPLRPTR"
^DIC(19,8501,"U")="REPLACE REMOVED PROBLEM(S) ON "
^DIC(19,8503,0)="ZPROBLEM LIST^PROBLEM LIST BIG MENUS^^M^11278^^^^^^^402"
