^DIC(19,8679,1,1,0)="This option allows the user to edit the effective date multiple of the"
^DIC(19,8679,1,2,0)="Facility Suffix (#45.68) file.  An effective date may be added, edited, or"
^DIC(19,8679,1,3,0)="deleted (this holds true for the ACTIVE? field within the multiple as"
^DIC(19,8679,1,4,0)="well). A status of the suffix, effective date(s), and active flag(s) will"
^DIC(19,8679,1,5,0)="be displayed prior and after editing.  This option is locked with the DG"
^DIC(19,8679,1,6,0)="PTFSUP security key."
