^DIC(19,8712,1,1,0)="This option will convert old records or records that do not have a"
^DIC(19,8712,1,2,0)="release status to Release Not Verified.  This option can only be used if"
^DIC(19,8712,1,3,0)="Release Control/Electronic Signature is turned on.  This option allows"
^DIC(19,8712,1,4,0)="the non-key holders to view the old records but not edit them.  Before"
^DIC(19,8712,1,5,0)="executing this option, turn on Release Control/Electronic Signature then"
^DIC(19,8712,1,6,0)="go into Enter/Edit and select the records that you want to remain as"
^DIC(19,8712,1,7,0)="draft status."
^DIC(19,8712,15)="D ^MCDIEDIE"
