^DIC(19,8878,1,2,0)="or devices to receive message transmissions (Patient ID, Provider ID,"
^DIC(19,8878,1,3,0)="Patient SSN, CPT Code, and date/time).  The message transmission occurs at"
^DIC(19,8878,1,4,0)="the time the Medicine procedure is signed and released and only when the"
^DIC(19,8878,1,5,0)="Workload reporting option is turned on."
^DIC(19,8878,15)="D ^MCDIEDIE"
