^DIC(19,9075,1,1,0)="This option, prompted for date range, lists all patients discharged"
^DIC(19,9075,1,2,0)="from the Claims Tracking file (#356) for Random, Disease, and Local"
^DIC(19,9075,1,3,0)="cases who will qualify for the national and local rollups."
