^DIC(19,9194,1,2,0)="a backup Build of all parts of a patch.  The backup Build will copy all of"
^DIC(19,9194,1,3,0)="the existing files, fields, routines, and components that are updated by "
^DIC(19,9194,1,4,0)="the patch into a backup build.  The end result will be a MailMan message"
^DIC(19,9194,1,5,0)="or a Host File that can be installed and will restore your system back"
^DIC(19,9194,1,6,0)="to a state before the patch."
