^DIC(19,9486,0)="PRCB BOC ADD/EDIT^Add/Edit BOC^^R^11740^^2921^^^^^"
^DIC(19,9486,1,0)="^^6^6^2941108^^^^"
^DIC(19,9486,1,1,0)="This option allows you to add a new budget object code or change the "
^DIC(19,9486,1,2,0)="name of an existing budget object code.  Whenever the program offices "
^DIC(19,9486,1,3,0)="in VA Central Office change the budget object codes that you use, you "
^DIC(19,9486,1,4,0)="will have to use this option to make the necessary changes to the "
^DIC(19,9486,1,5,0)="Budget Object Code File. You can use this option to create new entries "
^DIC(19,9486,1,6,0)="or to change the name or number of existing entries."
