^DIC(19,9641,0)="ENFAR6^Equipment Not Reported to FAP^^R^.5^^^^^^^33"
^DIC(19,9641,1,0)="^^8^8^2960401^^^^"
^DIC(19,9641,1,1,0)="This option generates a report of capitalized non-expendable (NX)"
^DIC(19,9641,1,2,0)="equipment which is not currently established in Fixed Assets (FAP)."
^DIC(19,9641,1,3,0)="Equipment which has a disposition date will not be included in the output."
^DIC(19,9641,1,4,0)="This report is intended to identify equipment items which should be"
^DIC(19,9641,1,5,0)="established in Fixed Assets by transmission of a FA Document (code sheet)."
^DIC(19,9641,1,6,0)=" "
^DIC(19,9641,1,7,0)="It is recommended that this option be scheduled to automatically print on"
^DIC(19,9641,1,8,0)="a weekly basis (via TaskManager)."
^DIC(19,9641,25)="ENFAR6"
^DIC(19,9641,200)="^^"
^DIC(19,9641,200.9)="y"
^DIC(19,9641,"U")="EQUIPMENT NOT REPORTED TO FAP"
^DIC(19,9642,0)="ENFAR7^Excessed Equipment Report^^R^11596^^^^^^^"
^DIC(19,9642,1,0)="^^8^8^2971023^^"
^DIC(19,9642,1,1,0)="This option generates a report of FA Documents (code sheets) which were"
^DIC(19,9642,1,2,0)="transmitted to FAP for standard general ledger 1524 (excess). This list is"
^DIC(19,9642,1,3,0)="intended to identify equipment assets which should have been picked up in"
^DIC(19,9642,1,4,0)="the FMS excess account by Fiscal Service."
^DIC(19,9642,1,5,0)=" "
^DIC(19,9642,1,6,0)="It is recommended that this option be scheduled to automatically print on"
^DIC(19,9642,1,7,0)="a monthly basis (via TaskManager). If automatically queued, the report"
^DIC(19,9642,1,8,0)="will include FA Documents transmitted within the last 30 days or so."
^DIC(19,9642,25)="ENFAR7"
^DIC(19,9642,200)="^^"
^DIC(19,9642,200.9)="y"
^DIC(19,9642,"U")="EXCESSED EQUIPMENT REPORT"
^DIC(19,9643,0)="ENFAR8^Accountable NX for Station^^R^11740^^^^^^^33"
^DIC(19,9643,1,0)="^^4^4^2991012^"
^DIC(19,9643,1,1,0)="This option generates a list of accountable equipment sorted by category"
^DIC(19,9643,1,2,0)="stock number and CMR for a specified station. Equipment must be on a CMR"
^DIC(19,9643,1,3,0)="in order to be included in this report. If desired, only capitalized"
^DIC(19,9643,1,4,0)="equipment can be listed on the output."
^DIC(19,9643,25)="ENFAR8"
^DIC(19,9643,"U")="ACCOUNTABLE NX FOR STATION"
^DIC(19,9644,0)="ENFA SEND BY STATION^Batch Send FA Documents (by Station)^^A^.5^ENFACS^^^^^^33^^1"
^DIC(19,9644,1,0)="^^7^7^2960318^"
^DIC(19,9644,1,1,0)="This option will send FA Documents (code sheets) to the Fixed Assets"
^DIC(19,9644,1,2,0)="package (FAP) in Austin for equipment belonging to a specified Station."
^DIC(19,9644,1,3,0)="Appropriate data will be extracted from the Equipment file and used to"
^DIC(19,9644,1,4,0)="populate the code sheets. Only equipment which is capitalized (CAPITALIZED"
^DIC(19,9644,1,5,0)="field = YES) and on a CMR (CMR field not blank) will be considered. FA"
^DIC(19,9644,1,6,0)="Documents will not be created for equipment entries already established in"
^DIC(19,9644,1,7,0)="FAP."
^DIC(19,9644,20)="S ENBAT(""XMT"")=1 D STN^ENFAXMTM K ENBAT(""XMT"")"
^DIC(19,9644,"U")="BATCH SEND FA DOCUMENTS (BY ST"
^DIC(19,9645,0)="ENFA VALCHK BY STATION^FAP Validity Check by Station (FA Documents)^^A^.5^^^^^^^33^^1"
^DIC(19,9645,1,0)="^^6^6^2960318^"
^DIC(19,9645,1,1,0)="This option will perform validity checks on equipment belonging to a"
^DIC(19,9645,1,2,0)="station to determine if FA Documents (code sheets) can be created for"
^DIC(19,9645,1,3,0)="those equipment entries. Only capitalized (CAPITALIZED field = YES)"
^DIC(19,9645,1,4,0)="equipment which is on a CMR (CMR field not blank) will be considered."
^DIC(19,9645,1,5,0)="Equipment which is already established in Fixed Assets will not be"
^DIC(19,9645,1,6,0)="checked."
^DIC(19,9645,20)="S ENBAT(""XMT"")=0 D STN^ENFAXMTM K ENBAT(""XMT"")"
^DIC(19,9645,"U")="FAP VALIDITY CHECK BY STATION "
^DIC(19,9646,0)="ENFA RECALC BALANCES^Recalculate FAP Balances^^R^.5^ENFACS^^^^^^33"
^DIC(19,9646,1,0)="^^8^8^2960326^"
^DIC(19,9646,1,1,0)="Dollar balances (by Station, Fund, SGL, and month) are maintained in the"
^DIC(19,9646,1,2,0)="FAP BALANCES file and printed on the Voucher Summary report. This option"
^DIC(19,9646,1,3,0)="can be used to recalculate the balances if they appear incorrect."
^DIC(19,9646,1,4,0)=" "
^DIC(19,9646,1,5,0)="The net $ activity for a specified month will be computed from the"
^DIC(19,9646,1,6,0)="individual FAP code sheets. The results are then compared to the values"
^DIC(19,9646,1,7,0)="maintined in the FAP BALANCES file. If there are any descrepancies, the"
^DIC(19,9646,1,8,0)="recalculated values can be used to update the FAP BALANCES file."
^DIC(19,9646,25)="RECALC^ENFABAL"
^DIC(19,9646,"U")="RECALCULATE FAP BALANCES"
^DIC(19,9647,0)="ENFAR9^Document History (FAP) for Equipment^^R^.5^^^^^^^33"
^DIC(19,9647,1,0)="^^2^2^2960424^^"
^DIC(19,9647,1,1,0)="This option lists Fixed Assets (FAP) documents (code sheets) which have"
^DIC(19,9647,1,2,0)="been sent for a specified equipment item."
^DIC(19,9647,25)="ENFAR9"
^DIC(19,9647,"U")="DOCUMENT HISTORY (FAP) FOR EQU"
^DIC(19,9648,0)="PRCB CARRY FORWARD QUARTERLY^Carry Forward Quarterly^^R^11740^^^^^^^121"
^DIC(19,9648,1,0)="^^1^1^2960306^^^^"
^DIC(19,9648,1,1,0)="This option is used to carry forward balances and unobligated requests."
^DIC(19,9648,25)="EN^PRCB1E"
^DIC(19,9648,"U")="CARRY FORWARD QUARTERLY"
^DIC(19,9649,0)="PRCB RPT FISCAL PENDING ACTION^Fiscal Pending Action^^R^10000000033^^^^^^^121"
^DIC(19,9649,1,0)="^19.06^3^3^3030618^^^^"
^DIC(19,9649,1,1,0)="This option will print all Purchase Orders with a status of Pending "
^DIC(19,9649,1,2,0)="Fiscal Action. It will also print all General Post Fund 2237s and 1358s "
^DIC(19,9649,1,3,0)="with a status of Pending Fiscal Action."
^DIC(19,9649,25)="EN^PRCB2A"
^DIC(19,9649,"U")="FISCAL PENDING ACTION"
^DIC(19,9650,0)="PRCB RPT ENTERED, NOT APP REQS^Entered, Not Approved Requests^^R^11740^^^^^^^121"
^DIC(19,9650,1,0)="^^1^1^2960422^^^"
^DIC(19,9650,1,1,0)="This option is used to print all entered, not approved requests."
^DIC(19,9650,25)="EN^PRCB2B"
^DIC(19,9650,"U")="ENTERED, NOT APPROVED REQUESTS"
^DIC(19,9651,0)="PRCS RPT ENTERED, NOT APP REQS^CP Entered, Not Approved Requests^^R^11740^^^^^^^121"
^DIC(19,9651,1,0)="^^3^3^2960422^"
^DIC(19,9651,1,1,0)="This option is used to print requests from the control point that"
^DIC(19,9651,1,2,0)="have not been approved by the Control Point Official. These requests will"
^DIC(19,9651,1,3,0)="have the status as ENTERED in the RUNNING BALANCE STATUS field."
^DIC(19,9651,25)="EN0^PRCB2B"
^DIC(19,9651,"U")="CP ENTERED, NOT APPROVED REQUE"
^DIC(19,9652,0)="PRCS REINSTATE^Reinstate IFCAP Terminated User^^R^11740^^^^^^^121"
^DIC(19,9652,1,0)="^19.06^3^3^3000608^^^^"
^DIC(19,9652,1,1,0)="This option is used to reinstate an IFCAP user who was terminated from the"
^DIC(19,9652,1,2,0)="computer system using the Kernel function.  The user may also added as a"
^DIC(19,9652,1,3,0)="Supply employee when reinstated, if appropriate."
^DIC(19,9652,25)="USERIN^PRCSUT41"
^DIC(19,9652,"U")="REINSTATE IFCAP TERMINATED USE"
^DIC(19,9653,0)="SRO M&M VERIFICATION REPORT^M&M Verification Report^^R^10000000216^^^^^^^^^1^1"
^DIC(19,9653,1,0)="^^34^34^3071126^"
^DIC(19,9653,1,1,0)="This option produces the M&M Verification Report which may be useful for"
^DIC(19,9653,1,2,0)="  (1) reviewing occurrences and their assignment to operations"
^DIC(19,9653,1,3,0)="  (2) reviewing death unrelated/related assignments to operations"
^DIC(19,9653,1,4,0)=" "
^DIC(19,9653,1,5,0)="The full report includes all patients who had operations within the "
^DIC(19,9653,1,6,0)="selected date range who experienced intraoperative occurrences,"
^DIC(19,9653,1,7,0)="postoperative occurrences or death within 90 days of surgery. The"
^DIC(19,9653,1,8,0)="pre-transmission report is similar but includes operations with completed"
^DIC(19,9653,1,9,0)="risk assessments that have not yet transmitted to the national database."
^DIC(19,9653,1,10,0)=" "
^DIC(19,9653,1,11,0)="Full Report:"
^DIC(19,9653,1,12,0)="Information is printed by patient, listing all operations for the patient"
^DIC(19,9653,1,13,0)="that occurred during the selected date range, plus any operations that may"
^DIC(19,9653,1,14,0)="have occurred within 30 days prior to any postoperative occurrences or"
^DIC(19,9653,1,15,0)="within 90 days prior to death. Therefore, this report may include some"
^DIC(19,9653,1,16,0)="operations that were performed prior to the selected date range and, if"
^DIC(19,9653,1,17,0)="printed by specialty, may include operations performed by other "
^DIC(19,9653,1,18,0)="specialties. For every operation listed, the intraoperative and"
^DIC(19,9653,1,19,0)="postoperative occurrences are listed. The report indicates if the"
^DIC(19,9653,1,20,0)="operation was flagged as unrelated or related to death and the risk"
^DIC(19,9653,1,21,0)="assessment type and status. The report may be printed for a selected list"
^DIC(19,9653,1,22,0)="of surgical specialties."
^DIC(19,9653,1,23,0)=" "
^DIC(19,9653,1,24,0)="Pre-Transmission Report:"
^DIC(19,9653,1,25,0)="Information is printed in a format similar to the full report. This report"
^DIC(19,9653,1,26,0)="lists all completed risk assessed operations that have not yet transmitted"
^DIC(19,9653,1,27,0)="to the national database and that have intraoperative occurrences,"
^DIC(19,9653,1,28,0)="postoperative occurrences, or death within 90 days of surgery. The report"
^DIC(19,9653,1,29,0)="includes any operations that may have occurred within 30 days prior to any"
^DIC(19,9653,1,30,0)="postoperative occurrences or within 90 days prior to death. Therefore,"
^DIC(19,9653,1,31,0)="this report may include some operations that may or may not be risk"
^DIC(19,9653,1,32,0)="assessed, and, if risk assessed, may have a status other than 'complete'."
^DIC(19,9653,1,33,0)="However, every patient listed on this report will have at least one"
^DIC(19,9653,1,34,0)="operation with a risk assessment status of 'complete'."
^DIC(19,9653,15)="D EXIT^SROVAR"
^DIC(19,9653,20)="D ^SROVAR"
^DIC(19,9653,22)="Q"
^DIC(19,9653,25)="SROACMP1"
^DIC(19,9653,"U")="M&M VERIFICATION REPORT"
^DIC(19,9654,0)="SRO DEATH RELATED^Update Operations as Unrelated/Related to Death^^R^11595^^^^^^^^^1^1"
