^DIC(19,9764,1,1,0)="The Intake and Output module is a useful tool that provides an on-line"
^DIC(19,9764,1,2,0)="tracking method for patient intake and/or output. The Intake and Output"
^DIC(19,9764,1,3,0)="module also allows for Intravenous Therapy tracking of fluids, IV starts"
