^DIC(19,9773,1,1,0)="The ADP coordinator can enter IV solutions into the GMRY NUR IV"
^DIC(19,9773,1,2,0)="SOLUTION file (#126.9) through this option.  The IV solutions include "
^DIC(19,9773,1,3,0)="admixtures, hyperals, intralipids, piggybacks and blood/blood products."
