^DIC(19,9774,1,0)="^^5^5^2960119^^^^"
^DIC(19,9774,1,1,0)="The shift starting hours stored in the GMRY NUR SHIFT/OTHER file (#126.95) "
^DIC(19,9774,1,2,0)="are used to calculate the patient's total intake/output for night, day and "
^DIC(19,9774,1,3,0)="evening shifts, respectively.  The data type for hours can be entered "
^DIC(19,9774,1,4,0)="""0800"", ""1600"" and ""2400"".  The heparin/saline default volume in milliliter"
^DIC(19,9774,1,5,0)="(ml) for locks/ports is also kept in the file #126.95."
