^DIC(19,9890,1,1,0)="This is the menu for editing reminder logic and making queries about the"
^DIC(19,9890,1,2,0)="files involved with Clinical Reminders and Clinical Maintenance components"
^DIC(19,9890,1,3,0)="in the Health Summary package."
