^DIC(19,10581,1,3,0)="adjusted. Drug prices in the DRUG file (#50) are compared with prices in"
^DIC(19,10581,1,4,0)="the Generic Inventory Package. Items can be loaded and reports can be"
^DIC(19,10581,1,5,0)="generated from a primary inventory point to a pharmacy location."
