^DIC(19,10592,1,2,0)="or master vault to maintain the stock and reorder levels or removes the"
^DIC(19,10592,1,3,0)="flag. It also allows the user to enter the stock and reorder levels. These"
^DIC(19,10592,1,4,0)="levels are used to determine the number of dispense units that need to be"
^DIC(19,10592,1,5,0)="ordered."
