^DIC(19,10602,1,1,0)="The Enter/Edit a Drug option adds a new drug to the pharmacy location. If"
^DIC(19,10602,1,2,0)="the drug is being added to the location and the location maintains stock"
^DIC(19,10602,1,3,0)="and reorder levels, it prompts for the stock and reorder levels. It also"
^DIC(19,10602,1,4,0)="displays the balance of an existing drug."
