^DIC(19,10656,0)="PXRR PCE ENCOUNTER SUMMARY^PCE Encounter Summary^^R^11597^^^^^^^507"
^DIC(19,10656,1,0)="^^36^36^2971020^"
^DIC(19,10656,1,1,0)="This report provides a summary of PCE encounters. For the purposes of this"
^DIC(19,10656,1,2,0)="report an encounter is any entry in the Visit File. The report can be run by"
^DIC(19,10656,1,3,0)="location or by provider. Encounters included in the report"
^DIC(19,10656,1,4,0)="are selected by a combination of date range, service categories, and encounter"
^DIC(19,10656,1,5,0)="types."
^DIC(19,10656,1,6,0)=""
^DIC(19,10656,1,7,0)="Data for the selected encounters is categorized and summarized in several ways."
^DIC(19,10656,1,8,0)="CPT codes associated with encounters are classified by Evaluation and"
^DIC(19,10656,1,9,0)="Management Code. Those falling into the E&M group are"
^DIC(19,10656,1,10,0)="sorted into the categories new, established, consult, and other."
^DIC(19,10656,1,11,0)=""
^DIC(19,10656,1,12,0)="The number of unique patients is determined for each location and for all the"
^DIC(19,10656,1,13,0)="locations selected for the report. The sum of the uniques for each location"
^DIC(19,10656,1,14,0)="will generally be larger than the total number of uniques"
^DIC(19,10656,1,15,0)="because a patient may be counted as a unique in more than one location but will"
^DIC(19,10656,1,16,0)="only be counted once for the entire facility."
^DIC(19,10656,1,17,0)=""
^DIC(19,10656,1,18,0)="Three visit totals are calculated. A visit is defined as any patient activity"
^DIC(19,10656,1,19,0)="at a location in one day.  Thus a patient having multiple encounters at a"
^DIC(19,10656,1,20,0)="location on one day will count as one visit. The three visit totals given are"
^DIC(19,10656,1,21,0)="total visits, inpatient visits, and outpatient visits. The sum of the inpatient"
^DIC(19,10656,1,22,0)="and outpatient visits will not be equal to the total visits if a patient had"
^DIC(19,10656,1,23,0)="both an inpatient and outpatient visit on the same day."
^DIC(19,10656,1,24,0)=""
^DIC(19,10656,1,25,0)="For each selected encounter an attempt is made to find an associated"
^DIC(19,10656,1,26,0)="appointment. This is done using the Outpatient Encounter file which provides a"
^DIC(19,10656,1,27,0)="link between encounters and appointments. Purpose of Visit data is tabulated"
^DIC(19,10656,1,28,0)="for each appointment that is found. Purpose of Visit includes the categories"
^DIC(19,10656,1,29,0)="C&P, 10-10, scheduled, and unscheduled."
^DIC(19,10656,1,30,0)=""
^DIC(19,10656,1,31,0)="If there is an appointment without an associated encounter it will not be"
^DIC(19,10656,1,32,0)="tabulated on this report. Cancelled and no-show appointments do not have an"
^DIC(19,10656,1,33,0)="associated encounter so they cannot be included in this report. Even if they"
^DIC(19,10656,1,34,0)="could, the information on cancelled and no-show appointments stored in"
^DIC(19,10656,1,35,0)="Scheduling is not complete making it impossible to give accurate counts."
^DIC(19,10656,1,36,0)=""
^DIC(19,10656,25)="PXRRWLD"
^DIC(19,10656,"U")="PCE ENCOUNTER SUMMARY"
^DIC(19,10657,0)="IB OUTPUT DAYS ON HOLD^Days on Hold Report^^R^10000000033^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,10657,1,0)="^^4^4^2970402^"
^DIC(19,10657,1,1,0)="This option produces the Days On Hold Report.  The report lists all"
^DIC(19,10657,1,2,0)="Integrated Billing charges that have been in the ON HOLD status for an"
^DIC(19,10657,1,3,0)="extended period of time.  Use the default to list charges that have been"
^DIC(19,10657,1,4,0)="on hold for longer than 60 days."
^DIC(19,10657,25)="MAIN^IBOHDT"
^DIC(19,10657,"U")="DAYS ON HOLD REPORT"
^DIC(19,10658,0)="IB OUTPUT CNT/AMT RPT^Count/Dollar Amount of Charges On Hold^^R^10000000033^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,10658,1,0)="^^5^5^2970529^"
^DIC(19,10658,1,1,0)="This option produces the Count and Dollar Amount of Charges On Hold"
^DIC(19,10658,1,2,0)="Report.  The report provides a subtotal and subcount, by action type, of"
^DIC(19,10658,1,3,0)="each patient charge with the status of ON HOLD.  These charges have not"
^DIC(19,10658,1,4,0)="been passed to Accounts Receivable.  Accounting is responsible for"
^DIC(19,10658,1,5,0)="supplying these figures to FMS on a monthly basis."
^DIC(19,10658,25)="EN^IBOHTOT"
^DIC(19,10658,"U")="COUNT/DOLLAR AMOUNT OF CHARGES"
^DIC(19,10659,0)="IB OUTPUT HISTORY OF HELD CHGS^History of Held Charges^^R^10000000033^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,10659,1,0)="^^5^5^2970528^"
^DIC(19,10659,1,1,0)="This option provides a count and dollar total of charges that have been on"
^DIC(19,10659,1,2,0)="hold for a date range.  The report sorts charges by their current status."
^DIC(19,10659,1,3,0)="Sites will be able to keep track of how many charges were cancelled,"
^DIC(19,10659,1,4,0)="released (billed), or remain on hold.  This report only counts charges"
^DIC(19,10659,1,5,0)="with an ON HOLD DATE defined."
^DIC(19,10659,25)="EN^IBOHIST"
^DIC(19,10659,"U")="HISTORY OF HELD CHARGES"
^DIC(19,10660,0)="IB OUTPUT RELEASED CHARGES RPT^On Hold/Hold-Review Charges Released to AR^^R^10000000020^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,10660,1,0)="^19.06^3^3^3031117^^^"
^DIC(19,10660,1,1,0)="This report lists all charges identified as once being on ON HOLD or on"
^DIC(19,10660,1,2,0)="HOLD-REVIEW status that currently have a status of BILLED and the DATE"
^DIC(19,10660,1,3,0)="LAST UPDATED falls within the date range the user specifies."
^DIC(19,10660,25)="EN^IBOHRAR"
^DIC(19,10660,"U")="ON HOLD/HOLD-REVIEW CHARGES RE"
^DIC(19,10661,0)="IB OUTPUT HELD CHARGES/PT^List Current/Past Held Charges by Pt^^R^10000000033^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,10661,1,0)="^^7^7^2970725^"
^DIC(19,10661,1,1,0)="This option lists all IB Actions for a patient that are currently on"
^DIC(19,10661,1,2,0)="hold or were on hold for a user specified date range.  The report lists IB"
^DIC(19,10661,1,3,0)="Action ID, Rate Type, Bill #, AR status, IB Status and information related"
^DIC(19,10661,1,4,0)="to corresponding Third Party Claims."
^DIC(19,10661,1,5,0)=" "
^DIC(19,10661,1,6,0)="Note: Only those charges placed on hold since the installation of patch"
^DIC(19,10661,1,7,0)="      IB*2*70 will appear on this report."
^DIC(19,10661,25)="MAIN^IBOHPT1"
^DIC(19,10661,"U")="LIST CURRENT/PAST HELD CHARGES"
^DIC(19,10662,0)="SCRPW ACRP REPORTS MENU^ACRP Reports Menu^^M^11281^^^^^^^16"
