^DIC(19,11026,1,1,0)="Based on Notification, Patient and optional Order Number and Default/"
^DIC(19,11026,1,2,0)="Regular Recipients, a list of recipients and potential recipients is "
^DIC(19,11026,1,3,0)="presented.  This is a tool for IRM or Clinical Coordinators only.  It will"
