^DIC(19,11030,1,4,0)="regarding how they processed the alert.  This option uses the Alert "
^DIC(19,11030,1,5,0)="Tracking file [^XTV(8992.1]."
^DIC(19,11030,1,6,0)="If an alert has an associated order number, it is displayed in brackets."
