^DIC(19,11049,1,1,0)="Determines if order check debug messages will be logged to ^XTMP(""ORKLOG""."
^DIC(19,11049,1,2,0)="'E' or 'Enabled' enables the logging of order checking debug information."
^DIC(19,11049,1,3,0)="'D' or 'Disabled' disables logging debug messages and cleans out"
^DIC(19,11049,1,4,0)="^XTMP(""ORKLOG"").  ^XTMP(""ORKLOG"" is also killed when more than 5,000 "
^DIC(19,11049,1,5,0)="entries exist.  Therefore, ^XTMP(""ORKLOG"") can only hold 5,000 entries."
