^DIC(19,11105,1,1,0)="Collect and display (vis List Manager) the mean number of days that"
^DIC(19,11105,1,2,0)="consults/requests take to be filled, from the time that they are"
^DIC(19,11105,1,3,0)="accepted by the service to the time that they are entered as Complete"
^DIC(19,11105,1,4,0)="in the computer.  Also lists the Standard Deviation and number of"
^DIC(19,11105,1,5,0)="consults that were found for a date range."
