^DIC(19,11159,1,2,0)="patients who had a mammogram or breast/pelvic/vaginal ultrasound exam"
^DIC(19,11159,1,3,0)="during the date range you select. These procedures and patients will be"
^DIC(19,11159,1,4,0)="added to the WH database if not already there."
