^DIC(19,11249,0)="AJK1UB STATISTICS (AUTO)^Collections Statistics (Auto)^^R^11600^^^^^^^"
^DIC(19,11249,1,0)="^^10^10^2990121^"
^DIC(19,11249,1,1,0)="This option should be set up as a scheduled option to be run daily, just"
^DIC(19,11249,1,2,0)="after midnight, to gather statistics concerning collections.  The routine"
^DIC(19,11249,1,3,0)="itself will determine whether or not the day in question is one on which"
^DIC(19,11249,1,4,0)="the collection of data should take place.  Collection of data and"
^DIC(19,11249,1,5,0)="formulation of the mail message will be based on (1) is this a day defined"
^DIC(19,11249,1,6,0)="in the Collections Parameter option on which data is to be reported or,"
^DIC(19,11249,1,7,0)="(2) is this the first of the month when data is to be collected and sent"
^DIC(19,11249,1,8,0)="to the MCCR program office.  Data is reported in an e-mail message and"
^DIC(19,11249,1,9,0)="sent to the TRANSMISSION MAIL GROUP as defined in your collections"
^DIC(19,11249,1,10,0)="parameters."
^DIC(19,11249,25)="AJK1UBFY"
^DIC(19,11249,"U")="COLLECTIONS STATISTICS (AUTO)"
