^DIC(19,11259,1,0)="^^5^5^2990107^"
^DIC(19,11259,1,1,0)="This is an option to record that an Item has been received and entered"
^DIC(19,11259,1,2,0)="into the Prosthetics Inventory.  Receiving an Item in Supply through the"
^DIC(19,11259,1,3,0)="IFCAP package does not update the Prosthetics Inventory module.  This"
^DIC(19,11259,1,4,0)="option has to be done seperately for an Item to be received and recorded"
^DIC(19,11259,1,5,0)="in the Prosthetics module."
