^DIC(19,11261,1,0)="^19.06^4^4^3011205^^"
^DIC(19,11261,1,1,0)="This is an option to print a daily Item statistics of all or particular"
^DIC(19,11261,1,2,0)="HCPCS and ITEMS that are in Prosthetics Inventory.  This option prints the"
^DIC(19,11261,1,3,0)="VA form 10-1210.  The report shows all the statistics of a particular"
^DIC(19,11261,1,4,0)="HCPCS and ITEMS and dollar amount for certain date range. "
