^DIC(19,11285,1,1,0)="This option is used by the coders to print the operation report on an"
^DIC(19,11285,1,2,0)="operation or the non-OR procedure report on a non-OR procedure."
^DIC(19,11285,15)="D EXIT^SROVAR"
