^DIC(19,11288,0)="SROA ONE-LINER UPDATE^Update 1-Liner Case^^R^10000000216^^^^^^^167^y^1^1"
^DIC(19,11288,1,0)="^^5^5^3101207^"
^DIC(19,11288,1,1,0)="This option may be used to enter missing data for the 1-liner cases (major"
^DIC(19,11288,1,2,0)="cases marked for exclusion from assessment, minor cases and cardiac"
^DIC(19,11288,1,3,0)="assessed cases that transmit to the VASQIP database as a single line or"
^DIC(19,11288,1,4,0)="two of data).  Cases edited with this option will be queued for"
^DIC(19,11288,1,5,0)="transmission to the VASQIP database at Chicago."
