^DIC(19,11294,1,1,0)="This option reviews multiple NOIS calls using the List Screen."
^DIC(19,11294,1,2,0)="The calls displayed in the List Screen can be changed using defined lists"
^DIC(19,11294,1,3,0)="or queries.  From the List Screen you can select calls for editing or"
^DIC(19,11294,1,4,0)="review."
