^DIC(19,11348,"U")="SET CREATININE DATE RANGE FOR "
^DIC(19,11349,0)="FBAA COST COMPARISON^RBRVS Fee Schedule Cost Comparison^^R^1999^^^^^^^344"
^DIC(19,11349,1,0)="^^20^20^2990826^^"
^DIC(19,11349,1,1,0)="This option generates a report of the estimated savings or cost from use"
^DIC(19,11349,1,2,0)="of the RBRVS Fee Schedule during a user-specified date range.  The Date"
^DIC(19,11349,1,3,0)="Finalized field is used to select the payments.  The results are grouped"
^DIC(19,11349,1,4,0)="and reported by CPT CODE-CPT MODIFIER(S) values.  Additional detail is"
^DIC(19,11349,1,5,0)="printed when the output device supports 130 characters per line.  The"
^DIC(19,11349,1,6,0)="report columns are described below:"
^DIC(19,11349,1,7,0)=" Total Occurrences: The count and total amount paid for all payments."
^DIC(19,11349,1,8,0)=" Payments at RBRVS: The count and total amount paid for payments whose"
^DIC(19,11349,1,9,0)="     amount paid is equal to the RBRVS fee schedule amount that was"
^DIC(19,11349,1,10,0)="     calculated during payment entry."
^DIC(19,11349,1,11,0)=" Estimated Payment if RBRVS was not used: This column is only displayed"
^DIC(19,11349,1,12,0)="     when the output device supports 130 characters per line.  It displays"
^DIC(19,11349,1,13,0)="     what the system believes might have been paid if the RBRVS fee"
^DIC(19,11349,1,14,0)="     schedule had not been implemented.  If the service is covered by"
^DIC(19,11349,1,15,0)="     the VA 75th Percentile Fee schedule, then the system assumes that"
^DIC(19,11349,1,16,0)="     payment would have been made at that amount.  Otherwise, the system"
^DIC(19,11349,1,17,0)="     assumes that the amount claimed is usual & customary and would have"
^DIC(19,11349,1,18,0)="     been paid."
^DIC(19,11349,1,19,0)=" Est. Savings from RBRVS: The estimated payment amounts minus the actual"
^DIC(19,11349,1,20,0)="    RBRVS payment amounts.  Negative values are shown in parenthesis."
^DIC(19,11349,25)="FBAAPCS"
^DIC(19,11349,"U")="RBRVS FEE SCHEDULE COST COMPAR"
^DIC(19,11350,0)="FBAA FEE SCHEDULE RATE^Calculate Payment Amount^^R^1999^^^^^^^344"
^DIC(19,11350,1,0)="^^5^5^2990826^"
^DIC(19,11350,1,1,0)="This option will calculate the fee schedule dollar amount for a service"
^DIC(19,11350,1,2,0)="(CPT Code). If the date of service is after September 1st, 1999 the"
^DIC(19,11350,1,3,0)="Medicare physician fee schedule (RBRVS) will be used.  If the RBRVS amount"
^DIC(19,11350,1,4,0)="is not greater than zero or if the date is prior to September 1999, the VA"
^DIC(19,11350,1,5,0)="75th Percentile fee schedule will be used to obtain an amount."
^DIC(19,11350,25)="LOOKUP^FBAAFS"
^DIC(19,11350,"U")="CALCULATE PAYMENT AMOUNT"
^DIC(19,11351,0)="RMPO ADD/EDIT PAT^Add/Edit Home Oxygen Patient^^R^11720^^^^^^^249"
