^DIC(19,11447,1,1,0)="This option indicates the status of a selected merge process (or all"
^DIC(19,11447,1,2,0)="of them) displaying the information provided by the last checkpoint"
^DIC(19,11447,1,3,0)="during its operation.  This information includes the file that is"
^DIC(19,11447,1,4,0)="being processed, which stage it is in, and the last internal entry"
^DIC(19,11447,1,5,0)="processed."
^DIC(19,11447,1,6,0)=""
^DIC(19,11447,1,7,0)="XT*7.3*46 reversed the order of printing from last to first."
^DIC(19,11447,1,8,0)=""
