^DIC(19,11545,1,2,0)="Patient Demographics (MPI/PD) menus. The sub-menus will be "
^DIC(19,11545,1,3,0)="assigned to other users as appropriate and are described in the "
^DIC(19,11545,1,4,0)="Implementation Guide."
