^DIC(19,11658,1,0)="^^2^2^3000210^"
^DIC(19,11658,1,1,0)="This report will print a list of the error codes and descriptions for"
^DIC(19,11658,1,2,0)="entries in the PCMM HL7 ERROR CODE file."
^DIC(19,11658,25)="ECRPRT^SCMCHLR7"
^DIC(19,11658,99.1)="59389,47775"
^DIC(19,11658,"U")="PCMM TRANSMISSION ERROR CODE R"
^DIC(19,11659,0)="SCMC PCMM TRANS ERROR REPORT^PCMM Transmission Error Report^This functionality is now accomplished by CDW/VSSC.^R^1^SCMC PCMM RETRANSMIT^^^^^^16"
^DIC(19,11659,1,0)="^^7^7^3000225^^^"
^DIC(19,11659,1,1,0)="This option will be used to produce the PCMM TRANSMISSION ERROR REPORT."
^DIC(19,11659,1,2,0)="This report will allow the user to print a list of patients for which HL7"
^DIC(19,11659,1,3,0)="transmission errors were received from the Austin Automation Center (AAC)."
^DIC(19,11659,1,4,0)="The user will have the ability to print all transmission errors or may"
^DIC(19,11659,1,5,0)="print errors for a selected date range.  Users will also have the ability"
^DIC(19,11659,1,6,0)="to sort the error list by <Patient Name>, <Date/Time Error Received>, or"
^DIC(19,11659,1,7,0)="<Provider Name>."
^DIC(19,11659,25)="TERPRT^SCMCHLR8"
^DIC(19,11659,99)="58128,41963"
^DIC(19,11659,99.1)="59389,47775"
^DIC(19,11659,"U")="PCMM TRANSMISSION ERROR REPORT"
^DIC(19,11660,0)="SCMC PCMM BASELINE SEEDING^PCMM Baseline Seeding^This functionality is now accomplished by the PCMM Web Application.^R^11740^^^^^^y^16^^"
^DIC(19,11660,1,0)="^19.06^12^12^3000407^^^^"
^DIC(19,11660,1,1,0)="This option will create a Primary Care Baseline Image based on all"
^DIC(19,11660,1,2,0)="Primary Care Assignment activity between the run date of this option and"
^DIC(19,11660,1,3,0)="the date your facility installed SD*5.3*177.  Each assignment activity"
^DIC(19,11660,1,4,0)="within the date range will create an entry in file 404.48, where it will"
^DIC(19,11660,1,5,0)="wait to be transmitted to the Austin Automation Center by the PCMM"
^DIC(19,11660,1,6,0)="background HL7 process.  The impact of these tranmissions could be severe."
^DIC(19,11660,1,7,0)="You may govern the number of HL7 messages which will be transmitted at any"
^DIC(19,11660,1,8,0)="given time by altering the value in the 'HL7 Transmit Limit' field of the"
^DIC(19,11660,1,9,0)="PCMM Parameter file."
^DIC(19,11660,1,10,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11660,1,11,0)="This option should NOT be run more than once.  It should be scheduled to"
^DIC(19,11660,1,12,0)="run via Taskman by qualified IRM personnel."
^DIC(19,11660,20)=""
^DIC(19,11660,25)="EN^SCMCCV6(0,0)"
^DIC(19,11660,200.9)="y"
^DIC(19,11660,"U")="PCMM BASELINE SEEDING"
^DIC(19,11661,0)="YS GAF TRANSMISSION^GAF Transmission^^R^11740^^^^^^^166^^"
^DIC(19,11661,1,0)="^19.06^2^2^3000802^^^^"
^DIC(19,11661,1,1,0)="This option is used to re-transmit GAF data to the National Patient Care"
^DIC(19,11661,1,2,0)="Database at the Austin Automation Center in Austin, TX."
^DIC(19,11661,20)=""
^DIC(19,11661,25)="START^YSGAFTR"
^DIC(19,11661,99.1)="58288,61346"
^DIC(19,11661,"U")="GAF TRANSMISSION"
^DIC(19,11662,0)="IBCN ID DUP INSURANCE ENTRIES^Generate Insurance Company Listings^^R^11740^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,11662,1,0)="^^5^5^2990531^^^^"
^DIC(19,11662,1,1,0)="This option allows users to search the Insurance Company (36#)"
^DIC(19,11662,1,2,0)="File to identify duplicate entries.  The file may be searched by"
^DIC(19,11662,1,3,0)="Insurance Company name, address, city, or state.  A listing"
^DIC(19,11662,1,4,0)="of Insurance Company names, address and phone number that meet"
^DIC(19,11662,1,5,0)="the search criteria will display."
^DIC(19,11662,25)="EN^IBCOMD"
^DIC(19,11662,"U")="GENERATE INSURANCE COMPANY LIS"
^DIC(19,11663,0)="IBCN POL W/NO EFF DATE REPORT^Active Policies with no Effective Date Report^^R^11740^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,11663,1,0)="^^5^5^2980930^"
^DIC(19,11663,1,1,0)="This option displays all Active Policies that have no effective"
^DIC(19,11663,1,2,0)="date for the search criteria entered. The report separates"
^DIC(19,11663,1,3,0)="Verified and Non-Verified policies and lists Patient information,"
^DIC(19,11663,1,4,0)="Insurance information and patient policy information.  This "
^DIC(19,11663,1,5,0)="report should be queued."
^DIC(19,11663,25)="EN^IBCOMA"
^DIC(19,11663,"U")="ACTIVE POLICIES WITH NO EFFECT"
^DIC(19,11664,0)="IBCN MOVE SUBSCRIB TO PLAN^Move Subscribers to a Different Plan^^R^11740^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,11664,1,0)="^^4^4^2981110^^^^"
^DIC(19,11664,1,1,0)="This option allows users to move subscribers to a different plan."
^DIC(19,11664,1,2,0)="The plan may be with the same or different Insurance Company."
^DIC(19,11664,1,3,0)="Annual Benefits, plan attributes and coverage limitations may be"
^DIC(19,11664,1,4,0)="moved as well."
^DIC(19,11664,25)="EN^IBCNSUR"
^DIC(19,11664,"U")="MOVE SUBSCRIBERS TO A DIFFEREN"
^DIC(19,11665,0)="IBCN PT W/WO INSURANCE REPORT^Patients with or without Insurance Report^^R^11740^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,11665,1,0)="^^10^10^3000125^^^^"
^DIC(19,11665,1,1,0)="This option provides a list of patients with or without insurance"
^DIC(19,11665,1,2,0)="coverage.  The report lists patients who received medical treatment"
^DIC(19,11665,1,3,0)="within a user specified date range, and may further be refined to"
^DIC(19,11665,1,4,0)="only list patients whose names or 'terminal digit' falls within a"
^DIC(19,11665,1,5,0)="specified range.  When printing the report of patients who have "
^DIC(19,11665,1,6,0)="insurance coverage, the report may be restricted to those patients"
^DIC(19,11665,1,7,0)="who have coverage with specific companies (up to six) or a range of"
^DIC(19,11665,1,8,0)="companies.  Additionally, the report may also be restricted to only"
^DIC(19,11665,1,9,0)="include patients whose age falls within a user specified date range."
^DIC(19,11665,1,10,0)="This report should be queued."
^DIC(19,11665,25)="EN^IBCOMC"
^DIC(19,11665,"U")="PATIENTS WITH OR WITHOUT INSUR"
^DIC(19,11666,0)="IBCN NO COVERAGE VERIFIED^Verification of No Coverage Report^^R^11740^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,11666,1,0)="^^3^3^2981009^"
^DIC(19,11666,1,1,0)="This option will list all Patients within the specified sort criteria"
^DIC(19,11666,1,2,0)="that have a No Coverage Verification Date entered. Verification of no"
^DIC(19,11666,1,3,0)="insurance coverage may need to be reviewed yearly."
^DIC(19,11666,25)="EN^IBCOMN"
^DIC(19,11666,"U")="VERIFICATION OF NO COVERAGE RE"
^DIC(19,11668,0)="IBCN SPLIT COMBO POLICIES^Separate Medicare Combination Policies^^R^11740^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,11668,1,0)="56^^63^63^2981110^"
^DIC(19,11668,1,1,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11668,1,2,0)="WARNING:  CAUTION SHOULD BE TAKEN WHEN USING THIS OPTION!!"
^DIC(19,11668,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11668,1,4,0)="This option should be used only on Medicare Group plans that were created"
^DIC(19,11668,1,5,0)="combining Part A and Part B coverage on the same policy.  The Medicare"
^DIC(19,11668,1,6,0)="Remittance Advice enhancements require patients to have separate Medicare,"
^DIC(19,11668,1,7,0)="will not reimburse, Part A  and Part B policies.  This tool will assist"
^DIC(19,11668,1,8,0)="sites with separating combined policies they may have.  The MCCR"
^DIC(19,11668,1,9,0)="Coordinator should select someone to have this option on their secondary"
^DIC(19,11668,1,10,0)="menu.  IRM may need to assist with the placement of the option. "
^DIC(19,11668,1,11,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11668,1,12,0)="Not all sites will need to run this option.  If this option is not needed"
^DIC(19,11668,1,13,0)="or no longer needed, please remove it from all user access.  This is a one"
^DIC(19,11668,1,14,0)="time run option and will be deleted in a future IB patch.  Users of this"
^DIC(19,11668,1,15,0)="option must be experienced with creating and managing Medicare Insurance"
^DIC(19,11668,1,16,0)="Information using the Patient Insurance Menu options.  When executing this"
^DIC(19,11668,1,17,0)="option the steps described below are executed. "
^DIC(19,11668,1,18,0)="    "
^DIC(19,11668,1,19,0)="   "
^DIC(19,11668,1,20,0)="Functional Description:  "
^DIC(19,11668,1,21,0)="    "
^DIC(19,11668,1,22,0)="   "
^DIC(19,11668,1,23,0)="1. A check will be made to ensure that the standard Medicare, Will not"
^DIC(19,11668,1,24,0)="   Reimburse, Part A and Part B plans are setup at the site.  If not,"
^DIC(19,11668,1,25,0)="   the site cannot proceed."
^DIC(19,11668,1,26,0)="     "
^DIC(19,11668,1,27,0)="2. This option will allow a user to select an Insurance Company "
^DIC(19,11668,1,28,0)="   whose Type of Coverage is Medicare.  This should be the Medicare"
^DIC(19,11668,1,29,0)="   company that holds the combination plan."
^DIC(19,11668,1,30,0)="        "
^DIC(19,11668,1,31,0)="3. The user selects a Medicare Insurance Company plan.  This should"
^DIC(19,11668,1,32,0)="   be the non-standard combination Part A and Part B plan."
^DIC(19,11668,1,33,0)="                              "
^DIC(19,11668,1,34,0)="4. The user will be asked if it is Okay to continue. "
^DIC(19,11668,1,35,0)="                                      "
^DIC(19,11668,1,36,0)="5. If the user responds 'NO' then nothing is changed and they are exited"
^DIC(19,11668,1,37,0)="   from the option."
^DIC(19,11668,1,38,0)="                   "
^DIC(19,11668,1,39,0)="6. If the user responds yes they have the opportunity to queue the output"
^DIC(19,11668,1,40,0)="   to a printer or their screen."
^DIC(19,11668,1,41,0)="     "
^DIC(19,11668,1,42,0)="7. Each policy associated with the combination plan will be changed to"
^DIC(19,11668,1,43,0)="   point to the standard Medicare Part A plan.  A duplicate copy of the"
^DIC(19,11668,1,44,0)="   policy will be created but associated with the standard Medicare"
^DIC(19,11668,1,45,0)="   Part B plan."
^DIC(19,11668,1,46,0)="   "
^DIC(19,11668,1,47,0)="8. A check for duplicate entries will be made."
^DIC(19,11668,1,48,0)="  "
^DIC(19,11668,1,49,0)="9. The output will list the policies that could not be converted."
^DIC(19,11668,1,50,0)="   If the patient already has a Medicare WNR Part A or Part B"
^DIC(19,11668,1,51,0)="   policy entered, the combination policy will remain with the "
^DIC(19,11668,1,52,0)="   combination plan and be listed on the report. These exceptions"
^DIC(19,11668,1,53,0)="   will need to be reviewed and inactivated manually."
^DIC(19,11668,1,54,0)="  "
^DIC(19,11668,1,55,0)="10. When no subscribers are left under the combination plan. All annual "
^DIC(19,11668,1,56,0)="    benefits coverage limitations associated with the non-standard "
^DIC(19,11668,1,57,0)="    combination plan will be deleted. "
^DIC(19,11668,1,58,0)="    "
^DIC(19,11668,1,59,0)="11. The non-standard combination plan will be deleted."
^DIC(19,11668,1,60,0)="     "
^DIC(19,11668,1,61,0)="12. If no plans and no subscribers are associated with the non-standard"
^DIC(19,11668,1,62,0)="    Medicare Insurance company, users may use the Delete a Company"
^DIC(19,11668,1,63,0)="    action to remove the Insurance Company entry."
^DIC(19,11668,25)="EN^IBCNSUX"
^DIC(19,11668,99.1)="58142,47158"
^DIC(19,11668,"U")="SEPARATE MEDICARE COMBINATION "
^DIC(19,11669,0)="IBCE LIST LOCAL^List All Local Print Fields^^P^10000000033^^^^^^^"
