^DIC(19,11671,0)="IBAT SUMMARY REPORT^Summary Report^^R^10000000033^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,11671,1,0)="^^13^13^2990312^"
^DIC(19,11671,1,1,0)="This report will create a transfer pricing statement summary.   This"
^DIC(19,11671,1,2,0)="bottom line to this overall summary yields the total number of episodes"
^DIC(19,11671,1,3,0)="and total amounts of those episodes per VISN/facility or groups of"
^DIC(19,11671,1,4,0)="VISN/facilities."
^DIC(19,11671,1,5,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11671,1,6,0)="1. You can select one or more VISN/facilities (home or preferred"
^DIC(19,11671,1,7,0)="VISN/facility) for summary data to accumulate from."
^DIC(19,11671,1,8,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11671,1,9,0)="2. You can select a date range for which those services were provided with"
^DIC(19,11671,1,10,0)="summary data inclusive."
^DIC(19,11671,1,11,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11671,1,12,0)="3. There is summary data on the report for Inpatient, Outpatient,"
^DIC(19,11671,1,13,0)="Pharmacy, and a Grand Total of the three."
^DIC(19,11671,25)="ENS^IBATO"
^DIC(19,11671,"U")="SUMMARY REPORT"
^DIC(19,11672,0)="IBAT TRANSFER PRICING MENU^Transfer Pricing Menu^^M^10000000033^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,11672,1,0)="^^1^1^2990312^"
^DIC(19,11672,1,1,0)="This menu will hold all the Transfer Pricing menu options."
^DIC(19,11672,10,0)="^19.01IP^7^7"
