^DIC(19,11673,0)="IBAT WORKLOAD REPORT^Workload Report^^R^10000000033^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,11673,1,0)="^^11^11^2990316^"
^DIC(19,11673,1,1,0)="This report shall enable the user to create a transfer pricing statement"
^DIC(19,11673,1,2,0)="workload detail.  The emphasis of this report is on work detail via Units."
^DIC(19,11673,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11673,1,4,0)="1. The user shall be able to select one or more VISN/facilities (home or"
^DIC(19,11673,1,5,0)="preferred VISN/facility) for workload data to accumulate from."
^DIC(19,11673,1,6,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11673,1,7,0)="2. The user shall be able to select a date range with summary data"
^DIC(19,11673,1,8,0)="inclusive."
^DIC(19,11673,1,9,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11673,1,10,0)="3. Workload detail data shall be available on the report along with the"
^DIC(19,11673,1,11,0)="Grand Total."
^DIC(19,11673,25)="ENW^IBATO"
^DIC(19,11673,"U")="WORKLOAD REPORT"
^DIC(19,11674,0)="IBAT PATIENT REPORT^Patient Detail Report^^R^10000000033^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,11674,1,0)="^^11^11^2990318^"
^DIC(19,11674,1,1,0)="This report will create a detailed listing of a transfer pricing statement"
^DIC(19,11674,1,2,0)="by patient.  This report will also aid in determining whether or not a"
^DIC(19,11674,1,3,0)="billable third party is involved."
^DIC(19,11674,1,4,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11674,1,5,0)="1. You will be able to select a VISN (home or preferred VISN) for detailed"
^DIC(19,11674,1,6,0)="data to accumulate from."
^DIC(19,11674,1,7,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11674,1,8,0)="2. You will be able to select a date range with summary data inclusive."
^DIC(19,11674,1,9,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11674,1,10,0)="3. Detail data will be available per patient on the report along with a"
^DIC(19,11674,1,11,0)="subtotal per patient and a Grand Total."
^DIC(19,11674,25)="ENP^IBATO"
^DIC(19,11674,"U")="PATIENT DETAIL REPORT"
^DIC(19,11675,0)="IBAT PATIENT LIST^Transfer Pricing Patient Listing^^R^10000000033^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,11675,1,0)="^^8^8^2990323^"
^DIC(19,11675,1,1,0)="This report will generate lists of transfer pricing patients by facility"
^DIC(19,11675,1,2,0)="or VISN."
^DIC(19,11675,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11675,1,4,0)="1. The data available on the report will include patient name, date of"
^DIC(19,11675,1,5,0)="birth, primary eligibility, SSN, and VISN."
^DIC(19,11675,1,6,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11675,1,7,0)="2. The report will be able to be sorted by patient, treating facility, or"
^DIC(19,11675,1,8,0)="by VISN."
^DIC(19,11675,25)="IBATOP"
^DIC(19,11675,"U")="TRANSFER PRICING PATIENT LISTI"
^DIC(19,11676,0)="IBAT EXCEL REPORT^Excel Formatted Report^^R^10000000033^^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,11676,1,0)="^^2^2^3000522^"
^DIC(19,11676,1,1,0)="This report will allow the user to select which fields they want printed"
^DIC(19,11676,1,2,0)="in an excel format.  It uses a pike (|) as the excel deliminator."
^DIC(19,11676,25)="ENEX^IBATO"
^DIC(19,11676,"U")="EXCEL FORMATTED REPORT"
^DIC(19,11677,0)="IBCR ENTER TP NEG RATES^Transfer Pricing Neg. Rates Enter/Edit^^R^10000000033^IB SUPERVISOR^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,11677,1,0)="^^5^5^2990907^"
^DIC(19,11677,1,1,0)="This option is used to enter/edit Transfer Pricing Negotiated rates."
^DIC(19,11677,1,2,0)="Rates can be negotiated between another VA Facility or an entire network"
^DIC(19,11677,1,3,0)="(VISN).  This option can only be used to edit rates in charge sets that"
^DIC(19,11677,1,4,0)="were previously set up using this option.  The rates entered here are"
^DIC(19,11677,1,5,0)="stored in Charge Master for use."
^DIC(19,11677,25)="ENTER^IBCRETP"
^DIC(19,11677,"U")="TRANSFER PRICING NEG. RATES EN"
^DIC(19,11678,0)="IBAT INPT PROSTHETIC ITEMS^Edit Inpatient Prosthetic Items^^E^1^IB SUPERVISOR^^^^^^192^^1^1"
^DIC(19,11678,1,0)="^19.06^4^4^3080307^^^^"
^DIC(19,11678,1,1,0)="This option will allow entering/editing/deleting of items that should be"
^DIC(19,11678,1,2,0)="billed for inpatient prosthetics.  Items in here will be automatically"
^DIC(19,11678,1,3,0)="billed by the nightly background job for inpatients.  No other inpatient"
^DIC(19,11678,1,4,0)="issued items will be automatically billed."
^DIC(19,11678,15)="K DLAYGO,DIDEL"
^DIC(19,11678,20)="S (DLAYGO,DIDEL)=351.67"
^DIC(19,11678,30)="IBAT(351.67,"
^DIC(19,11678,31)="AEMQL"
