^DIC(19,11679,0)="PXRM EXTRACT EPI FINDING LIST^Extract EPI List by Finding and SSN^^P^10000000020^^^^^^y^534"
^DIC(19,11679,1,0)="^^30^30^3000825^"
^DIC(19,11679,1,1,0)="This option allows printing extract results stored in the REMINDER"
^DIC(19,11679,1,2,0)="EXTRACT SUMMARY file (810.3).  This option lists extracted data by"
^DIC(19,11679,1,3,0)="finding item and social security number. The finding items are loaded into"
^DIC(19,11679,1,4,0)="the REMINDER EXTRACT SUMMARY file when one of the following options is"
^DIC(19,11679,1,5,0)="run:"
^DIC(19,11679,1,6,0)="   LREPI ENHANCE MANUAL RUN    Lab Search/Extract Manual Run (Enhanced)"
^DIC(19,11679,1,7,0)="   LREPI NIGHTLY TASK          Lab Search/Extract Nightly Task"
^DIC(19,11679,1,8,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11679,1,9,0)="The Lab EPI (Emerging Pathogens Initiative) extract name follows the"
^DIC(19,11679,1,10,0)="convention: LREPI YY/MM MMDDYY, where the YY/MM is the year and month from"
^DIC(19,11679,1,11,0)="the date range specified by the LREPI extract option that created the"
^DIC(19,11679,1,12,0)="extract. MMDDYY is the month, day and year that the extract was run. The"
^DIC(19,11679,1,13,0)="prefix of LREPI identifies the extract as the result of LREPI extract"
^DIC(19,11679,1,14,0)="options (manual or automatic run for the LREPI Lab Search/Extract"
^DIC(19,11679,1,15,0)="Protocol)."
^DIC(19,11679,1,16,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11679,1,17,0)="To print all extracts for the target reporting month,enter ""LREPI YY/MM"""
^DIC(19,11679,1,18,0)="at the FROM prompt, with the year and month's data to be reported.  At"
^DIC(19,11679,1,19,0)="the TO prompt, you can limit the print to extracts for the reporting month"
^DIC(19,11679,1,20,0)="by adding a suffix to the LREPI YY/MM, for example ""LREPI YY/MM z"" will"
^DIC(19,11679,1,21,0)="get all extracts that were created for the target reporting month,"
^DIC(19,11679,1,22,0)="regardless of when they were run."
^DIC(19,11679,1,23,0)=" "
^DIC(19,11679,1,24,0)="If there have been multiple runs for the target month, you can further"
^DIC(19,11679,1,25,0)="define the FROM and TO range by specifying LREPI YY/MM MMDDYY with the"
^DIC(19,11679,1,26,0)="MMDDYY being the date the report was run. There will normally only be one"
^DIC(19,11679,1,27,0)="extract per month.  More than one will exist if your site runs the LREPI"
^DIC(19,11679,1,28,0)="ENHANCE MANUAL RUN to correct errors found by the Austin Automation"
^DIC(19,11679,1,29,0)="Center on the monthly transmission of EPI data sent by the LREPI NIGHTLY"
^DIC(19,11679,1,30,0)="TASK."
^DIC(19,11679,60)="PXRMXT(810.3,"
^DIC(19,11679,63)="[PXRM EXTRACT EPI FINDING LIST]"
^DIC(19,11679,64)="[PXRM EXTRACT EPI BY FIND_PT]"
^DIC(19,11679,"U")="EXTRACT EPI LIST BY FINDING AN"
