^DIC(19,11680,1,1,0)="This option is used to summarize total counts for each type of finding"
^DIC(19,11680,1,2,0)="item that was extracted for the target date range of the LREPI ENHANCE"
^DIC(19,11680,1,3,0)="MANUAL RUN or the LREPI NIGHTLY TASK option run."
