^DIC(19,11835,1,1,0)="this option will be activated only through the Task Manager and will"
^DIC(19,11835,1,2,0)="control the effort to automatically generate a distribution ordder for all"
^DIC(19,11835,1,3,0)="secondary inventory points linked to a supply station."
