^DIC(19,11836,1,1,0)="This option will be activated only through the Task Manager and will"
^DIC(19,11836,1,2,0)="control the effort to automatically generate a distribution order for"
^DIC(19,11836,1,3,0)="all secondary inventory points not linked to a supply station."
