^DIC(19,12078,0)="FBUC EXTENSION^Extension for Incomplete Mill Bill (1725) Claim^^R^10000000020^FBAASUPERVISOR^^^^^^344"
^DIC(19,12078,1,0)="^^6^6^3011119^"
^DIC(19,12078,1,1,0)="This option is used by a supervisor to enter an extension for an"
^DIC(19,12078,1,2,0)="incomplete claim submitted under the provisions of 38 U.S.C. 1725 (Mill"
^DIC(19,12078,1,3,0)="Bill).  The normal expiration date for these claims is calculated as 31"
^DIC(19,12078,1,4,0)="days after the request information letter was sent.  However, if an"
^DIC(19,12078,1,5,0)="extension has been entered for a claim then the extension date will be"
^DIC(19,12078,1,6,0)="used as the expiration date if it is later than the calculated date."
