^DIC(19,12173,"U")="RADIOLOGY HL7 MENU"
^DIC(19,12174,0)="RA CREDIT IMAGING LOCATION^Credit completed exams for an Imaging Location^^R^10000000020^^^^^^^31"
^DIC(19,12174,1,0)="^^10^10^3020724^"
^DIC(19,12174,1,1,0)="This option is used to assign ""REGULAR CREDIT"" to completed exams that "
^DIC(19,12174,1,2,0)="have all required data, but did not receive credit because their Imaging "
^DIC(19,12174,1,3,0)="Location was incorrectly assigned as ""NO CREDIT"".  Before this option"
^DIC(19,12174,1,4,0)="can be used, the incorrectly defined Imaging Location must have its "
^DIC(19,12174,1,5,0)="CREDIT METHOD field changed from ""NO CREDIT"" to ""REGULAR CREDIT"". "
^DIC(19,12174,1,6,0)=" "
^DIC(19,12174,1,7,0)="The option will prompt for the Imaging Location, then the starting and"
^DIC(19,12174,1,8,0)="ending exam dates.  The user should choose no more than a month's worth "
^DIC(19,12174,1,9,0)="of data to process each time, because of the background tasks involved in "
^DIC(19,12174,1,10,0)="crediting an exam."
^DIC(19,12174,25)="EN1^RAKRDIT"
^DIC(19,12174,"U")="CREDIT COMPLETED EXAMS FOR AN "
^DIC(19,12175,0)="RA VISTARAD CATEGORY P^VistaRad Category Print^^A^10000000020^^^^^^^31^^1"
^DIC(19,12175,1,0)="^^6^6^3020425^"
^DIC(19,12175,1,1,0)="This option is to be used only if you are using the VistaRad component of "
^DIC(19,12175,1,2,0)="the Imaging package.  "
^DIC(19,12175,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(19,12175,1,4,0)="In the option, you will be asked to select one or more Imaging types, then"
^DIC(19,12175,1,5,0)="select a device.  The current VISTARAD CATEGORY value for all exam"
^DIC(19,12175,1,6,0)="statuses of these Imaging types will be displayed/printed."
^DIC(19,12175,20)="D VRADP^RAXSTAT"
^DIC(19,12175,"U")="VISTARAD CATEGORY PRINT"
^DIC(19,12176,0)="RA VISTARAD CATEGORY E^VistaRad Category Entry/Edit^^A^10000000020^^^^^^^31^^1"
^DIC(19,12176,1,0)="^^7^7^3020425^"
^DIC(19,12176,1,1,0)="This option is to be used only if you are using the VistaRad component of "
^DIC(19,12176,1,2,0)="the Imaging package.  "
^DIC(19,12176,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(19,12176,1,4,0)="In the option, you will be asked to select one Imaging type and an"
^DIC(19,12176,1,5,0)="examination status, then you will be prompted to enter/edit the value of"
^DIC(19,12176,1,6,0)="VISTARAD CATEGORY.  The option will continue to ask for another"
^DIC(19,12176,1,7,0)="examination status, until you are done with that Imaging type."
^DIC(19,12176,20)="D VRADE^RAUTL19"
^DIC(19,12176,"U")="VISTARAD CATEGORY ENTRY/EDIT"
^DIC(19,12177,0)="RA SET PREFERENCE LONG DISPLAY^Set preference for Long Display of Procedures^^R^10000000020^^^^^^^31"
^DIC(19,12177,1,0)="^^9^9^3020717^"
^DIC(19,12177,1,1,0)="This option can be used to set preference for long display of procedures, "
^DIC(19,12177,1,2,0)="procedure modifiers, and CPT modifiers in all Radiology reports.  That "
^DIC(19,12177,1,3,0)="is, if a procedure and associated modifiers are repeated in the same "
^DIC(19,12177,1,4,0)="exam, each of the repeated procedure and modifier will be listed in the "
^DIC(19,12177,1,5,0)="Radiology report, instead of being listed only once."
^DIC(19,12177,1,6,0)=" "
^DIC(19,12177,1,7,0)="This option can also be used to remove your previously set preference for "
^DIC(19,12177,1,8,0)="long display of procedures, and return to the condensed display of "
^DIC(19,12177,1,9,0)="procedures."
^DIC(19,12177,25)="SETL^RAPROD"
^DIC(19,12177,"U")="SET PREFERENCE FOR LONG DISPLA"
^DIC(19,12178,0)="LRCAPES^LAB CPT BILLING^^R^10000000020^^^^^^^26^^^1"
^DIC(19,12178,1,0)="^^16^16^3010524^"
^DIC(19,12178,1,1,0)=" This option is used to perform two functions"
^DIC(19,12178,1,2,0)="Using accessioned tests identified in the ACCESSION (#68)."
^DIC(19,12178,1,3,0)="."
^DIC(19,12178,1,4,0)=" 1) Allows the manual assignment of CPT codes for billing if the ordering"
^DIC(19,12178,1,5,0)="location is an out patient location type as indicated in the HOSPITAL"
^DIC(19,12178,1,6,0)="LOCATION (#44) file."
^DIC(19,12178,1,7,0)=" 2) Allows the recording of laboratory workload for all HOSPITAL LOCATION"
^DIC(19,12178,1,8,0)="types."
^DIC(19,12178,1,9,0)=" "
^DIC(19,12178,1,10,0)="If the ES DISPLAY ORDER (#26) field of the WKLD CODE (#64) file is"
^DIC(19,12178,1,11,0)="populated, the user can select from a picklist of predefined WKLD CODES."
^DIC(19,12178,1,12,0)="In addition, the user is able to enter any valid CPT code directly."
^DIC(19,12178,1,13,0)="  If the location is appropriate, CPT billing codes will passed to the LAB"
^DIC(19,12178,1,14,0)="PCE API."
^DIC(19,12178,1,15,0)="  The WKLD CODE associated with the CPT code will be added to the"
^DIC(19,12178,1,16,0)="laboratory workload for an accessioned test."
^DIC(19,12178,10.1)="LAB CPT BILLING/WORKLOAD"
^DIC(19,12178,15)="D CLEAN^LRCAPES"
^DIC(19,12178,25)="ASK^LRCAPES"
^DIC(19,12178,"U")="LAB CPT BILLING"
^DIC(19,12179,0)="GMRC IFC INC RPT^Print All Incomplete IFC Transactions^^R^10000000020^^^^^^^294^^^"
^DIC(19,12179,1,0)="^19.06^2^2^3021218^^^^"
^DIC(19,12179,1,1,0)="This option will print all incomplete IFC transactions sorted by Consult "
^DIC(19,12179,1,2,0)="number."
