^DIC(19,12226,1,1,0)="This option will display the Drug Text Name, Synonyms, Drug Text, "
^DIC(19,12226,1,2,0)="Inactive date if inactive, and list all drug and pharmacy orderable items "
^DIC(19,12226,1,3,0)="linked to it.  The report is printable for one or all entries."
