^DIC(19,12275,1,0)="^^6^6^3021216^"
^DIC(19,12275,1,1,0)="This option will allow the authorized user the ability to test the "
^DIC(19,12275,1,2,0)="cleanup process of the 3 Patient Relation & Income type files, 408.12, "
^DIC(19,12275,1,3,0)="408.21, & 408.22.  An HL7 error left some of these files partially "
^DIC(19,12275,1,4,0)="stubbed in and not pointing to their proper entries in the related "
^DIC(19,12275,1,5,0)="files.  This option will produce the XTMP(""DG488"" global for review prior "
^DIC(19,12275,1,6,0)="to actually performing the cleanup."
