^DIC(19,12366,1,0)="^^7^7^3030320^"
^DIC(19,12366,1,1,0)="This is a protocol to link other packages that want to know about a USER"
^DIC(19,12366,1,2,0)="CHANGE event. Other pachages can attach to this protocol option and they"
^DIC(19,12366,1,3,0)="will be called when a USER is Edited.  "
^DIC(19,12366,1,4,0)="DUZ will be the person that is running the edit the user option.  "
^DIC(19,12366,1,5,0)="XUIFN will point to the NEW PERSON file entry that has been changed."
^DIC(19,12366,1,6,0)="Returns selected file 200 data to XUSR(field name) array for New Person"
