^DIC(19,12386,0)="EAS MT APPT EXPIRATION RPT^Means Test Expiration by Appt Date^Disabled by the VFA project. Do not use.^A^10000000020^^^^^^^538^^1"
^DIC(19,12386,1,0)="^^4^4^3020610^"
^DIC(19,12386,1,1,0)="This report provides a list by clinic and appointment date of patients"
^DIC(19,12386,1,2,0)="whose means test anniversary date will be reached on the date of their "
^DIC(19,12386,1,3,0)="appointment.  Report displays by clinic the name, last four, anniversary"
^DIC(19,12386,1,4,0)="date and time of appointment."
