^DIC(19,12771,1,1,0)="This option produces the ACTIVE BILLS WITH EEOBs report.  This report"
^DIC(19,12771,1,2,0)="contains a list of bills by insurance company that have EEOBs on file"
^DIC(19,12771,1,3,0)="and also have a balance greater than 0."
