^DIC(19,12772,1,1,0)="This option produces the report of EFT deposits and their corresponding"
^DIC(19,12772,1,2,0)="EFT detail records.  It allows the site to determine which CR documents"
^DIC(19,12772,1,3,0)="still have dollars associated with them that have not yet been transferred"
^DIC(19,12772,1,4,0)="via TR documents from 5287.4/8NZZ into the appropriate accounts."
