^DIC(19,12979,1,1,0)="This option allows a user to enter/edit relevant clinical information"
^DIC(19,12979,1,2,0)="that should be sent with a test when it is shipped."
^DIC(19,12979,1,3,0)=""
^DIC(19,12979,1,4,0)="Examples include reporting the amount of inspired carbon dioxide for"
^DIC(19,12979,1,5,0)="blood gasses, the point in the menstrual cycle for cervical pap tests,"
^DIC(19,12979,1,6,0)="and other conditions that influence test interpretations. Peak and"
^DIC(19,12979,1,7,0)="trough times for antibiotic and therapeutic drug levels."
^DIC(19,12979,25)="RCI^LA7SM2"
^DIC(19,12979,"U")="EDIT RELEVANT CLINICAL INFORMA"
