^DIC(19,13004,0)="PXRM EXTRACT PATIENT LIST^Patient List Management^^R^1^^^^^^^534"
^DIC(19,13004,1,0)="^19.06^7^7^3050426^^^^"
^DIC(19,13004,1,1,0)="This option manages reminder patient lists. Local patient lists may be"
^DIC(19,13004,1,2,0)="created from list rules, copied to OE/RR teams, copied to other patient"
^DIC(19,13004,1,3,0)="lists or deleted."
^DIC(19,13004,1,4,0)=" "
^DIC(19,13004,1,5,0)="Local patient lists and national patient lists (from the extract process) "
^DIC(19,13004,1,6,0)="are listed. Individual lists may be displayed or printed or used to run "
^DIC(19,13004,1,7,0)="health summaries."
^DIC(19,13004,25)="START^PXRMLPU(0)"
^DIC(19,13004,"U")="PATIENT LIST MANAGEMENT"
^DIC(19,13005,0)="PXRM EXTRACT MANAGEMENT^Reminder Extract Management^^R^1^^^^^^^534"
^DIC(19,13005,1,0)="^^40^40^3060508^"
^DIC(19,13005,1,1,0)="This option uses list manager to view an extract definition, examine and "
^DIC(19,13005,1,2,0)="schedule an extract run or transmission run, view extract summary results "
^DIC(19,13005,1,3,0)="and view extract patient lists."
^DIC(19,13005,1,4,0)=" "
^DIC(19,13005,1,5,0)="Each extract definition is identified by an Extract Name.  Extract names"
^DIC(19,13005,1,6,0)="are displayed as selectable items. When an extract name is selected,"
^DIC(19,13005,1,7,0)="the list manager actions allow the user to "
^DIC(19,13005,1,8,0)="- view and edit the extract definition"
^DIC(19,13005,1,9,0)="- view the existing history of extract run information, with the most "
^DIC(19,13005,1,10,0)="recent extract runs displayed first.  "
^DIC(19,13005,1,11,0)=" "
^DIC(19,13005,1,12,0)="Viewing the existing history of extract runs, provides a list of extract "
^DIC(19,13005,1,13,0)="runs. When selecting a particular extract run, list manager actions allow "
^DIC(19,13005,1,14,0)="the user to:"
^DIC(19,13005,1,15,0)="-- Change the view"
^DIC(19,13005,1,16,0)="-- View the extract results stored in the Extract Summary file"
^DIC(19,13005,1,17,0)="-- Schedule a Manual Extract run"
^DIC(19,13005,1,18,0)="-- Schedule a Manual Transmission run for an existing national extract run"
^DIC(19,13005,1,19,0)="-- View the Transmission History "
^DIC(19,13005,1,20,0)=" "
^DIC(19,13005,1,21,0)="When the Extract Summary action is selected, the user can "
^DIC(19,13005,1,22,0)="--- view patient lists used for the run or "
^DIC(19,13005,1,23,0)="--- view the extract summary results. "
^DIC(19,13005,1,24,0)=" "
^DIC(19,13005,1,25,0)="The extract summary results will contain compliance totals, similar to a "
^DIC(19,13005,1,26,0)="reminder due report.  The extract results may optionally contain finding "
^DIC(19,13005,1,27,0)="totals if the extract definition contains counting rules for a particular "
^DIC(19,13005,1,28,0)="reminder.   "
^DIC(19,13005,1,29,0)=" "
^DIC(19,13005,1,30,0)="Prior extract summaries for a given extract type can be displayed with "
^DIC(19,13005,1,31,0)="their HL7 transmission status and history. Reminder and finding totals of "
^DIC(19,13005,1,32,0)="individual extract summaries may be displayed or printed if required. The "
^DIC(19,13005,1,33,0)="patient lists generated by each extract may be displayed or used to print "
^DIC(19,13005,1,34,0)="health summaries if required."
^DIC(19,13005,1,35,0)="      "
^DIC(19,13005,1,36,0)="National extract runs and transmissions to the Austin Automation Center "
^DIC(19,13005,1,37,0)="(AAC) can be monitored from the actions. National extracts are the only "
^DIC(19,13005,1,38,0)="extracts that can be transmitted to the AAC. Actions allow extracts and "
^DIC(19,13005,1,39,0)="transmissions runs to be initiated for a selected prior period manually. "
^DIC(19,13005,1,40,0)="Existing extracts may also be re-transmitted if required.         "
^DIC(19,13005,25)="PXRMETM"
^DIC(19,13005,"U")="REMINDER EXTRACT MANAGEMENT"
^DIC(19,13007,0)="PXRM EDIT SITE DISCLAIMER^Edit Site Disclaimer^^A^10000000020^^^^^^y^534^^1"
