^DIC(19,13027,1,0)="^^7^7^3060508^"
^DIC(19,13027,1,1,0)="This option allows creation/editing of extract counting groups.  Each "
^DIC(19,13027,1,2,0)="group defines reminder terms. Counting groups are used when an extract "
^DIC(19,13027,1,3,0)="definition is defined to accumulate COMPLIANCE and FINDING TOTALS (TYPE "
^DIC(19,13027,1,4,0)="OF TOTALS).  The counting groups are used in a counting rule during the "
^DIC(19,13027,1,5,0)="extract process to count findings within a group. The reminder term, "
^DIC(19,13027,1,6,0)="related counting group, and finding total counts are stored in the "
^DIC(19,13027,1,7,0)="Extract Reminder Summary file."
^DIC(19,13027,20)="D START^PXRMEGM(0)"
^DIC(19,13027,"U")="EXTRACT COUNTING GROUP MANAGEM"
