^DIC(19,13136,1,2,0)="facility whenever an action is done which results in the need to update"
^DIC(19,13136,1,3,0)="the status.  For example, when HDIS receives a notification from the"
^DIC(19,13136,1,4,0)="application developer patch that a specific file is ready for "
^DIC(19,13136,1,5,0)="standardization, HDIS prepares the file for transport and assignes a"
^DIC(19,13136,1,6,0)="status to ""Started"".  That status would be sent to the central HDIS"
^DIC(19,13136,1,7,0)="Server."
