^DIC(19,13192,1,0)="^19.06^3^3^3010607^^^"
^DIC(19,13192,1,1,0)="This option will be used to transmit the 2162 data from closed ASISTS cases"
^DIC(19,13192,1,2,0)="to the Austin Automation Center for processing to the National Database.  It"
^DIC(19,13192,1,3,0)="will be a scheduled option that should be run monthly."
