^DIC(19,13203,1,1,0)="This option will allow authorized users to edit the Pharmacy extracts"
^DIC(19,13203,1,2,0)="(BCM, IVP, PRE or UDP). Corrections will be allowed to the Quantity field "
^DIC(19,13203,1,3,0)="for the IVP, PRE and UDP extracts. Additionally, correction will be "
^DIC(19,13203,1,4,0)="allowed to the Unit of Issue field for the PRE extract and the Total "
^DIC(19,13203,1,5,0)="Doses per Day for the IVP extract. For the BCM extract, correction will "
^DIC(19,13203,1,6,0)="be allowed for the Component Dose Given and Component Units fields."
^DIC(19,13203,25)="EN^ECXPHVE"
^DIC(19,13203,"U")="PHARMACY VOLUME EDIT"
