^DIC(19,13404,0)="PRSP ESR SAP^Approve Signed ESRs^^R^1^^^^^^^230"
^DIC(19,13404,1,0)="^19.06^7^7^3050222^^^^"
^DIC(19,13404,1,1,0)="A T&A Supervisor of a part-time physician is required to review and take"
^DIC(19,13404,1,2,0)="one of the following actions on each signed day of the part-time"
^DIC(19,13404,1,3,0)="physician's ESR: (A)pprove, (B)ypass or mark the ESR for (R)esubmission."
^DIC(19,13404,1,4,0)="When the T&A Supervisor approves a signed daily ESR, this option"
^DIC(19,13404,1,5,0)="attempts to update the part-time physician's timecard for that day. "
^DIC(19,13404,1,6,0)="Updates to the timecard will be screened based on the status of the"
^DIC(19,13404,1,7,0)="timecard and the effect of any potential update. "
^DIC(19,13404,10.1)="Approve ESRs"
^DIC(19,13404,25)="MAIN^PRSPSAP"
^DIC(19,13404,"U")="APPROVE SIGNED ESRS"
^DIC(19,13405,0)="PRSP TK POST^Post PT Physician Time^^R^1^^^^^^^230^^1^1"
^DIC(19,13405,1,0)="^^9^9^3050302^"
^DIC(19,13405,1,1,0)="This option allows the timekeeper to post timecard data for a "
^DIC(19,13405,1,2,0)="part-time physician that has a Memoranda of Service Level"
^DIC(19,13405,1,3,0)="Expectations.  This action should only be done at the direction of the"
^DIC(19,13405,1,4,0)="T&L Supervisor when the physician's Electronic Subsidiary Record"
^DIC(19,13405,1,5,0)="(ESR) can not be completed before timecard certification for the pay"
^DIC(19,13405,1,6,0)="period.  Unscheduled regular time (RG) will only be tracked via the"
^DIC(19,13405,1,7,0)="ESR, and can not be posted to the timecard.  The timekeeper is"
^DIC(19,13405,1,8,0)="prompted for a date and whether or not to post the timecards in "
^DIC(19,13405,1,9,0)="alphabetical order."
