^DIC(19,13518,1,1,0)="This option will list the ""Food""-type GMR Allergy (#120.82) file entries"
^DIC(19,13518,1,2,0)="and the Allergy-type Food Preference (#115.2) file entry that each will"
^DIC(19,13518,1,3,0)="correspond to."
