^DIC(19,13537,1,0)="^19.06^4^4^3070327^^^^"
^DIC(19,13537,1,1,0)="This option prints a report of those encounters whose service connected"
^DIC(19,13537,1,2,0)="was changed and not yet billed. If a user has the supervisor key they"
^DIC(19,13537,1,3,0)="will also be able to run the supervisor option which contains the names of"
^DIC(19,13537,1,4,0)="the last two editors."
