^DIC(19,13560,0)="ECXSCLIST^Clinics and DSS Stop Codes Report Export^^R^1^^^^^^^513"
^DIC(19,13560,1,0)="^19.06^18^18^3170911^^"
^DIC(19,13560,1,1,0)="Using this option, a worksheet may be printed for the DSS extract"
^DIC(19,13560,1,2,0)="manager to use when creating the CLINICS AND STOP CODES file (#728.44). "
^DIC(19,13560,1,3,0)="This worksheet relates clinics, the stop codes for those clinics used by"
^DIC(19,13560,1,4,0)="MAS/HAS, and the stop codes required by DSS."
^DIC(19,13560,1,5,0)=" "
^DIC(19,13560,1,6,0)="If the 'UNREVIEWED CLINICS' option is selected, then a synchronization"
^DIC(19,13560,1,7,0)="will first be performed on the CLINICS AND STOP CODES file (#728.44)."
^DIC(19,13560,1,8,0)="This is the same synchronization that is performed when the user runs"
^DIC(19,13560,1,9,0)="the 'Create DSS Clinic Stop Code File' menu option. If clinics have "
^DIC(19,13560,1,10,0)="been added since the last synchronization, those events will be "
^DIC(19,13560,1,11,0)="captured and reported on the 'UNREVIEWED CLINICS' report. Any of the"
^DIC(19,13560,1,12,0)="following changes to the clinic's record in the HOSPITAL LOCATION file"
^DIC(19,13560,1,13,0)="(#44) will be captured and reported, as well:"
^DIC(19,13560,1,14,0)=" "
^DIC(19,13560,1,15,0)="     - the active status of the clinic;"
^DIC(19,13560,1,16,0)="     - its non-count status;"
^DIC(19,13560,1,17,0)="     - the stop code;"
^DIC(19,13560,1,18,0)="     - the credit stop code."
^DIC(19,13560,25)="PRINT^ECXSCLD"
^DIC(19,13560,"U")="CLINICS AND DSS STOP CODES REP"
^DIC(19,13561,0)="ECXSETUP^Generate the Inpatient Setup Extract^^R^10000000020^ECXMGR^^^^^^513^^1"
^DIC(19,13561,1,0)="^^7^7^2950421^^^^"
^DIC(19,13561,1,1,0)="This option generates the inpatient setup extract which creates"
^DIC(19,13561,1,2,0)="the hospital population for the selected DSS start up date. This data"
^DIC(19,13561,1,3,0)="is stored in the ADMISSION SETUP EXTRACT file (#727.82), the"
^DIC(19,13561,1,4,0)="PHYSICAL MOVEMENT SETUP EXTRACT file (#727.821), and the"
^DIC(19,13561,1,5,0)="TREATING SPECIALTY CHANGE SETUP EXTRACT file (#727.822) until"
^DIC(19,13561,1,6,0)="the data is transmitted to the commercial vendor. The option MUST"
^DIC(19,13561,1,7,0)="only be run once."
^DIC(19,13561,20)="W !!!,""WARNING."",!,""This is very resource intensive and should be queued to run at slack time."",!!!"
^DIC(19,13561,25)="EN^ECXSETUP"
^DIC(19,13561,"U")="GENERATE THE INPATIENT SETUP E"
