^DIC(19,13575,1,1,0)="This option prints a list of all Primary Care Teams.  The list is sorted"
^DIC(19,13575,1,2,0)="alphabetically by TEAM name and displays the pointer to the TEAM file"
^DIC(19,13575,1,3,0)="(#404.51). The intent of this option is to provide help for building"
^DIC(19,13575,1,4,0)="primary care teams on the commercial DSS System."
