^DIC(19,13602,1,1,0)="This report generates a list of equipment that has a value in the "
^DIC(19,13602,1,2,0)="NON-SPACE FILE LOCATION field.  Equipment should only have a value in this"
^DIC(19,13602,1,3,0)="field when the LOCATION field can not be updated because an appropriate"
^DIC(19,13602,1,4,0)="location is not available in the ENG SPACE file.  Ideally, equipment will "
^DIC(19,13602,1,5,0)="not remain on this report for an extended period."
^DIC(19,13602,25)="ENTINSR"
^DIC(19,13602,"U")="NON-SPACE FILE LOCATION REPORT"
