^DIC(19,13628,1,0)="^^12^12^3080312^"
^DIC(19,13628,1,1,0)="This option searches a pay period for employees with scheduled tour hours"
^DIC(19,13628,1,2,0)="that don't match the employee's 8B Normal Hours.  In some cases hours that"
^DIC(19,13628,1,3,0)="carry over from a two day tour on the last Saturday of the pay period "
^DIC(19,13628,1,4,0)="prior to the one being searched can be the source of the mismatch.  "
^DIC(19,13628,1,5,0)="Timecards for employees on this report cannot be certified until all"
^DIC(19,13628,1,6,0)="scheduled hours from midnight Saturday through midnight Saturday match the"
^DIC(19,13628,1,7,0)="8B Normal Hours.  Either the tour or 8B Normal Hours should be updated"
^DIC(19,13628,1,8,0)="through established processes for any employee appearing on this report "
^DIC(19,13628,1,9,0)="for an uncertified pay period.  Optionally, Tours of Duty and Tour Hours "
^DIC(19,13628,1,10,0)="can be displayed.  The Tour Hours column contains a total of any tour "
