^DIC(19,13669,1,1,0)="This report will provide the local sites with an option to generate a"
^DIC(19,13669,1,2,0)="report listing consults requested, consults completed, consult completion"
^DIC(19,13669,1,3,0)="rates, completed consults with results attached and rate of completed"
^DIC(19,13669,1,4,0)="consults with results attached for a user determined date range."
^DIC(19,13669,1,5,0)=" "
^DIC(19,13669,1,6,0)="For completed consults with results attached, the report includes those "
^DIC(19,13669,1,7,0)="consults that have results attached either in the TIU, Medicine or "
^DIC(19,13669,1,8,0)="Clinical Procedures applications."
^DIC(19,13669,1,9,0)=" "
^DIC(19,13669,1,10,0)="Excluded from the report are: Prosthetics consults, Consults with a status"
^DIC(19,13669,1,11,0)="of Cancelled or Discontinued, and Inter-facility Consults (IFC) requests"
^DIC(19,13669,1,12,0)="where the reporting site is the sending site for the IFC."
^DIC(19,13669,1,13,0)=" "
^DIC(19,13669,1,14,0)="The report can be run in a summary format to view on screen or print and "
^DIC(19,13669,1,15,0)="a comma delimited format for importing into in spreadsheet and/or database"
^DIC(19,13669,1,16,0)="software."
^DIC(19,13669,25)="EN^GMRCSTLA"
^DIC(19,13669,"U")="CONSULTS LOCAL COMPLETION RATE"
