^DIC(19,13675,1,1,0)="This server is used to update Surgery Transplant Assessments that "
^DIC(19,13675,1,2,0)="have been successfully transmitted to the Surgery Risk Assessment"
^DIC(19,13675,1,3,0)="National Database at the Chicago ISC.  This server updates two fields,"
^DIC(19,13675,1,4,0)="ASSESSMENT STATUS (#181) and DATE TRANSMITTED (#184). These fields are "
^DIC(19,13675,1,5,0)="updated at the site from the message sent by the database servers at"
^DIC(19,13675,1,6,0)="Chicago only if the messages were processed successfully into the "
^DIC(19,13675,1,7,0)="national database."
