^DIC(19,13688,1,3,0)="STATUS (#987.8) file.  The WII ADT ALL SITES file contains the data that "
^DIC(19,13688,1,4,0)="will be used for the data transmission to the DOD.  WII STATION STATUS "
^DIC(19,13688,1,5,0)="file is used to track the sending stations process."
