^DIC(19,13845,1,2,0)="extract file (#727.829), where the data reflects static information; the "
^DIC(19,13845,1,3,0)="other half of the report pulls current directly from the source (either "
^DIC(19,13845,1,4,0)="the Lab Date file, #63, or the VBECs Blood Bank file, #6002.03)."
