^DIC(19,14017,0)="FB SEG DUTY RPT^Fee Basis 1358 Segregation of Duty Report^^R^1^FBAASUPERVISOR^^^^^^344"
^DIC(19,14017,1,0)="^^36^36^3110411^"
^DIC(19,14017,1,1,0)="This report reviews fee invoice certification events and determines if "
^DIC(19,14017,1,2,0)="there was a segregation of duty violation.  The certifier of a fee invoice"
^DIC(19,14017,1,3,0)="must not be the requestor, approving official, or obligator of the"
^DIC(19,14017,1,4,0)="associated 1358 obligation or any increase/decrease adjustments to the"
^DIC(19,14017,1,5,0)="1358 that were obligated before the invoice certification took place."
^DIC(19,14017,1,6,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14017,1,7,0)="The release of a payment batch by a fee supervisor is the certification "
^DIC(19,14017,1,8,0)="event.  The report examines all payment batches that were released during "
^DIC(19,14017,1,9,0)="a specified period.  Each batch is associated with a single 1358. "
^DIC(19,14017,1,10,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14017,1,11,0)="The results are sorted by 1358 and within that by the date and time of an "
^DIC(19,14017,1,12,0)="event.  Three event types may be listed."
^DIC(19,14017,1,13,0)="  Obligate - Initial obligation of the 1358 in IFCAP."
^DIC(19,14017,1,14,0)="  Adjust   - Obligation of an increase/decrease to the 1358 in IFCAP."
^DIC(19,14017,1,15,0)="  Certify  - Release of a fee payment batch associated with the 1358 "
^DIC(19,14017,1,16,0)="             by a fee supervisor.  The batch number is shown."
^DIC(19,14017,1,17,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14017,1,18,0)="The IFCAP events have three roles (requestor, approver, and obligator)."
^DIC(19,14017,1,19,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14017,1,20,0)="The specified reporting period is used to select released fee batches.  "
^DIC(19,14017,1,21,0)="All prior IFCAP events for the 1358 are relevant to segregation to duty"
^DIC(19,14017,1,22,0)="and will be considered even if they precede the reporting period."
^DIC(19,14017,1,23,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14017,1,24,0)="If YES is entered at the ""Only list 1358s with a violation (Y/N)?"" prompt,"
^DIC(19,14017,1,25,0)="only 1358s with at least one violation will be displayed.  Additionally,"
^DIC(19,14017,1,26,0)="the fee certifications (batch release) that do not violate segregation of"
^DIC(19,14017,1,27,0)="duties will not be displayed.  IFCAP and Fee Basis have been enhanced "
^DIC(19,14017,1,28,0)="by patches PRC*5.1*148 and FB*3.5*117 to enforce segregation of duties for"
^DIC(19,14017,1,29,0)="a 1358 so no violations are expected after installation of those patches."
^DIC(19,14017,1,30,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14017,1,31,0)="The Fee Basis batch data can optionally be purged by a site.  The IFCAP "
^DIC(19,14017,1,32,0)="data is normally retained for at least 7 years, but must be purged prior "
^DIC(19,14017,1,33,0)="to 10 years since the document numbers are recycled. If the source data"
^DIC(19,14017,1,34,0)="for this report has been purged, it will not be included in the report.  "
^DIC(19,14017,1,35,0)="Selection of a period starting 9 or more years ago may return inaccurate "
^DIC(19,14017,1,36,0)="results due to recycling of 1358 document numbers."
^DIC(19,14017,25)="FBAASDR"
^DIC(19,14017,"U")="FEE BASIS 1358 SEGREGATION OF "
^DIC(19,14018,0)="IB CORRECT REJECTED/DENIED^Correct Rejected/Denied Bill^^R^10000000216^IB AUTHORIZE^^^^^^192"
^DIC(19,14018,1,0)="^^2^2^3100604^"
^DIC(19,14018,1,1,0)="This option will allow correcting a rejected or denied bill which has"
^DIC(19,14018,1,2,0)="not had any payments posted to it."
^DIC(19,14018,25)="CRD^IBCCC"
^DIC(19,14018,"U")="CORRECT REJECTED/DENIED BILL"
^DIC(19,14019,0)="PSS ENABLE/DISABLE DB LINK^Enable/Disable Vendor Database Link^^R^10000000216^^^^^^^517"
^DIC(19,14019,1,0)="^19.06^4^4^3090622^^^"
^DIC(19,14019,1,1,0)="This option provides the ability to disable/enable the link to the vendor interface used for"
^DIC(19,14019,1,2,0)="enhanced order checking."
^DIC(19,14019,1,3,0)="When disabled, NO drug-drug interaction, duplicate therapy or dosing order checks will "
^DIC(19,14019,1,4,0)=" be performed in Pharmacy and in Computerized Patient Record System (CPRS)."
^DIC(19,14019,25)="EN^PSSDSFDB"
^DIC(19,14019,"U")="ENABLE/DISABLE VENDOR DATABASE"
