^DIC(19,14095,1,1,0)="This option allows you to remove an ERA from the active worklist."
^DIC(19,14095,1,2,0)="You may only select an ERA that is unmatched to paper check and that is "
^DIC(19,14095,1,3,0)="UNPOSTED. Use this option only if a receipt number is not available; "
^DIC(19,14095,1,4,0)="otherwise, use the 'Update an ERA posted using paper EOB' option."
^DIC(19,14095,1,5,0)="This marks the POSTED status of the ERA as NOT POSTED-REMOVED"
^DIC(19,14095,1,6,0)="and the EFT MATCH STATUS to MATCHED. Option is locked with RCDPE MARK ERA "
^DIC(19,14095,1,7,0)="key."
^DIC(19,14095,25)="RETN^RCDPEM2"
^DIC(19,14095,"U")="REMOVE ERA FROM ACTIVE WORKLIS"
^DIC(19,14096,0)="RCDPE REMOVED ERA AUDIT^Remove ERA from Active Worklist Audit Report^^R^1^^^^^^^261^^"
^DIC(19,14096,1,0)="^19.06^2^2^3120117^^"
