^DIC(19,14186,1,1,0)="Check Lab Tests by subscript (MI, SP or CY) for their mapped NLT and"
^DIC(19,14186,1,2,0)="Electronic Codes. These codes are required for LEDI transmission of"
^DIC(19,14186,1,3,0)="orders and reports. Provides Lists for correctly mapped tests or"
