^DIC(19,14378,1,1,0)="This Broker (Client/Server) menu option is used exclusively by the "
^DIC(19,14378,1,2,0)="Identity and Access Management (IAM) Provisioning application."
^DIC(19,14378,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14378,1,4,0)="The XUSHOWSSN Security Key is required to lookup users based on PII (SSN "
^DIC(19,14378,1,5,0)="and DoB) and to display SSN and DoB information about users. The XUSPF200"
^DIC(19,14378,1,6,0)="Security Key is required to add and edit users."
