^DIC(19,14431,1,2,0)="radiation over a specified date range. Within date range, the user is "
^DIC(19,14431,1,3,0)="asked to filter data by Primary Interpreting Staff, CPT & patient."
^DIC(19,14431,25)="EN^RADRPT2"
^DIC(19,14431,"U")="RADIATION DOSE SUMMARY REPORT"
