^DIC(19,14482,1,11,0)="Number of Certification Action Code of C (Cancelled) received."
^DIC(19,14482,1,12,0)="Number of Certification Action Code of CT (Contact Payer) received."
^DIC(19,14482,1,13,0)="Number of Certification Action Code of NA (No Action Required) received."
^DIC(19,14482,1,14,0)="Total numbers of Certification Action Codes."
^DIC(19,14482,1,15,0)="Review Decision Reason Code (Patient Event)."
