^DIC(19,14488,1,1,0)="This option is used to setup the Pharmacy Automated Dispensing Equipment "
^DIC(19,14488,1,2,0)="(PADE) system like Pyxis, Omnicell, AccuDose, etc., which has dispensing"
^DIC(19,14488,1,3,0)="cabinets distributed around the VA Medical Centers to stock and dispense"
^DIC(19,14488,1,4,0)="drug/non-drug items in Inpatient Wards or Outpatient Clinics. Defining "
^DIC(19,14488,1,5,0)="the wards/clinics associated with a division, and mapping to a PADE "
^DIC(19,14488,1,6,0)="cabinet (location/area), is crucial for VistA to communicate precisely the"
^DIC(19,14488,1,7,0)="outbound messages related to ADT, clinic visits, order details, drug "
^DIC(19,14488,1,8,0)="formulary etc.  "
