^DIC(19,14494,1,1,0)="This menu contains options used to set up Pharmacy Automated Dispensing "
^DIC(19,14494,1,2,0)="Equipment (PADE) Inbound information. PADE vendor system parameters may "
^DIC(19,14494,1,3,0)="be set, including the activation of the display of  vendor drug item"
^DIC(19,14494,1,4,0)="balances in Inpatient Order Entry and the entry of mail groups to which"
^DIC(19,14494,1,5,0)="inbound HL7 error messages are sent. Individual PADE dispensing device"
^DIC(19,14494,1,6,0)="(cabinet) parameters may also be defined, including initializing the"
^DIC(19,14494,1,7,0)="device, activating/inactiving the device, and linking the device to a"
^DIC(19,14494,1,8,0)="hospital division and ward or clinic location."
