^DIC(19,14500,1,1,0)="This menu contains options to run Pharmacy Automated Dispensing Equipment "
^DIC(19,14500,1,2,0)="(PADE) Inbound inventory reports. The PADE Transaction Report contains"
^DIC(19,14500,1,3,0)="information on individual HL7 transactions received from the PADE vendor,"
^DIC(19,14500,1,4,0)="and is run for a specific date range. The PADE On Hand Report contains "
^DIC(19,14500,1,5,0)="current inventory information for each drug item stocked in each PADE "
^DIC(19,14500,1,6,0)="dispensing device (cabinet)."
