^DIC(19,14508,1,1,0)="This option is used for generating a list of immunization administration"
^DIC(19,14508,1,2,0)="records transmitted to external agencies. This option allows for a date"
^DIC(19,14508,1,3,0)="range selection as well as one, multiple or all agencies and one, multiple"
^DIC(19,14508,1,4,0)="or all patients. The list is sorted by disclosure date/time, agency, and"
^DIC(19,14508,1,5,0)="then by patient."
