^DIC(19,14541,1,2,0)="resistant organism (MDRO) that is to be searched for.  This information "
^DIC(19,14541,1,3,0)="is used to obtain prior history of MDRO and to display precaution "
^DIC(19,14541,1,4,0)="measures for the selected organism(s)."
