^DIC(19,14546,0)="MMRS CDI REPORT (TASKED)^Print CDI Report (Tasked)^^R^1^^^^^^^"
^DIC(19,14546,1,0)="^19.06^7^7^3161206^^^"
^DIC(19,14546,1,1,0)="This option should not be run interactively - it should only be"
^DIC(19,14546,1,2,0)="tasked to run via Taskman. This option will print the Facility CDI Report "
^DIC(19,14546,1,3,0)="and will use a one month default date range."
^DIC(19,14546,1,4,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14546,1,5,0)="In order for this report to run successfully, the option will have to be "
^DIC(19,14546,1,6,0)="scheduled in TaskMan.  When configuring this option, it will be necessary "
^DIC(19,14546,1,7,0)="to set a default device and interval run time."
^DIC(19,14546,25)="MAIN^MMRSCDI2"
^DIC(19,14546,200.9)="y"
