^DIC(19,14610,0)="ECXTPR^Test Patient List^^R^11720^^^^^^^"
^DIC(19,14610,1,0)="^^17^17^3170228^"
^DIC(19,14610,1,1,0)="This option will identify any patients that are considered to be test "
^DIC(19,14610,1,2,0)="patients by DSS standards or that have a last name that starts with ZZ."
^DIC(19,14610,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14610,1,4,0)="For DSS purposes, test patients are identified as those having an SSN "
^DIC(19,14610,1,5,0)="with 3 leading zeroes, 2 middle zeroes, consecutive numbers 1 to 9, "
^DIC(19,14610,1,6,0)="repeating numbers in all 9 digits (all ones, all twos, etc.) or having 3 "
^DIC(19,14610,1,7,0)="leading sixes."
^DIC(19,14610,1,8,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14610,1,9,0)="In the past, test patients were identified by putting ZZ in front of "
^DIC(19,14610,1,10,0)="their last name.  This report will include all patients whose last name "
^DIC(19,14610,1,11,0)="starts with ZZ.  These patients may, or may not be, test patients."
^DIC(19,14610,1,12,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14610,1,13,0)="The report includes the patient's Vista test patient status (five leading "
^DIC(19,14610,1,14,0)="zeroes in the SSN) as well as the DSS test patient status to help you "
^DIC(19,14610,1,15,0)="determine if the patient identified is a test patient."
^DIC(19,14610,1,16,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14610,1,17,0)="This report can be printed or exported, as needed."
^DIC(19,14610,25)="ECXTPR"
^DIC(19,14610,"U")="TEST PATIENT LIST"
^DIC(19,14611,0)="ECXPROMR^Prosthetics Rental Report^^R^1^^^^^^^"
^DIC(19,14611,1,0)="^^11^11^3190227^"
^DIC(19,14611,1,1,0)="This option will search through the RECORD OF PROS APPLIANCE/REPAIR file "
^DIC(19,14611,1,2,0)="and identify any records that are rentals.  "
^DIC(19,14611,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14611,1,4,0)="The user selectable time frame is based on the delivery date. "
^DIC(19,14611,1,5,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14611,1,6,0)="The user may select all divisions or one division.  The division comes"
^DIC(19,14611,1,7,0)="from the MEDICAL CENTER DIVISION file but its associated INSTITUTION value"
^DIC(19,14611,1,8,0)="is used to sort the records by the STATION field in the RECORD OF PROS"
^DIC(19,14611,1,9,0)="APPLIANCE/REPAIR file."
^DIC(19,14611,1,10,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14611,1,11,0)="The report can be printed or exported."
^DIC(19,14611,25)="ECXPROMR"
^DIC(19,14611,"U")="PROSTHETICS RENTAL REPORT"
^DIC(19,14612,0)="ECXPROUI^Prosthetics Unit of Issue Report^^R^11720^^^^^^^"
^DIC(19,14612,1,0)="^^7^7^3170306^"
^DIC(19,14612,1,1,0)="This report will show all entries in the UNIT OF ISSUE file (#420.5) that "
^DIC(19,14612,1,2,0)="can be used within the prosthetics package."
^DIC(19,14612,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14612,1,4,0)="The report will show the 2 character name as well as the full name of the "
^DIC(19,14612,1,5,0)="unit."
^DIC(19,14612,1,6,0)=" "
^DIC(19,14612,1,7,0)="The report can be printed or exported."
^DIC(19,14612,25)="ECXPROUI"
^DIC(19,14612,"U")="PROSTHETICS UNIT OF ISSUE REPO"
