^DIC(19,14689,1,1,0)="The purpose of this option is to allow the pharmacy to edit the QUICK "
^DIC(19,14689,1,2,0)="ORDER AUDIT GROUPS file OR(100.953. This file is used to limit the "
^DIC(19,14689,1,3,0)="content of the QUICK ORDER AUDIT MONTHLY report by MEDICAL CENTER "
