^DIC(19,14736,1,2,0)="verified.  If issues are found such as alerts which were not queued or "
^DIC(19,14736,1,3,0)="the Orders (#100) file not set correctly, a MailMan message and alert are "
^DIC(19,14736,1,4,0)="sent to the person invoking the option as well as the MailMan group ""LMI""."
