^DIC(19,15038,1,1,0)="This option will allow user to grant a forbearance (i.e. skip) to a "
^DIC(19,15038,1,2,0)="scheduled payment in a Repayment Plan.  The skipped payment will be moved "
^DIC(19,15038,1,3,0)="to the end of the repayment plan and extend the schedule by one month."
