^DIC(19,15053,1,2,0)="Indications, Other Indications and Free Text Indications used in"
^DIC(19,15053,1,3,0)="the Pharmacy orders. Unit Dose count includes Inpatient and Clinic Unit "
^DIC(19,15053,1,4,0)="Dose, and IV count includes Inpatient and Clinic IV.  The report does not"
