^DIC(19,15084,1,1,0)="This option (EC) provides two ways to create a possible erroneous comments report to aid in cleanup of IFC comments belonging to consults for another patient. A formatted version of the report and a delmited version of the report are now "
^DIC(19,15084,1,2,0)="available by selecting the SCR or CSV options. "
^DIC(19,15084,1,3,0)="The reports include interfacility consults of activity type UPDATE/COMPLETE where there are associated or remote-associated results and also comments. These comments are the possible erroneous comments that need to be reviewed and possibly "
^DIC(19,15084,1,4,0)="removed."
