^DIC(19,15115,1,0)="^^7^7^3201002^"
^DIC(19,15115,1,1,0)="This option starts a TaskMan job that checks for missing or invalid "
^DIC(19,15115,1,2,0)="Provider Narrative pointers. When it is missing or invalid it will be "
^DIC(19,15115,1,3,0)="replaced with the default value, which is the ICD long description. Since "
^DIC(19,15115,1,4,0)="Provider Narrative Category is not a required field, invalid pointers "
^DIC(19,15115,1,5,0)="will be deleted. If a V POV entry is missing the pointer to the Visit "
^DIC(19,15115,1,6,0)="file or the pointed to Visit file entry does not exist, the V POV entry "
^DIC(19,15115,1,7,0)="will be skipped."
