^DIC(19,15116,1,2,0)="Provider Narrative pointers. When it is missing or invalid it will be "
^DIC(19,15116,1,3,0)="replaced with the default value, which is the CPT short description. "
^DIC(19,15116,1,4,0)="Since Provider Narrative Category is not a required field, invalid "
^DIC(19,15116,1,5,0)="pointers will be deleted. If a V CPT entry is missing the pointer to the "
^DIC(19,15116,1,6,0)="Visit file or the pointed to Visit file entry does not exist, the V CPT "
^DIC(19,15116,1,7,0)="entry will be skipped."
^DIC(19,15116,25)="TASKVCPT^PXPNARR"
