^DIC(19,15218,1,1,0)="Sends the Service Consults By Status report to a device without going"
^DIC(19,15218,1,2,0)="throuh the List Manager display of the report and waiting for the list to"
^DIC(19,15218,1,3,0)="be built."
^DIC(19,15218,1,4,0)="Cloned from ""GMRC PRINT RPT NUMBERED"" option."
