^DIC(19,15338,1,1,0)="This option lets you create or change quick orders. The dialog for"
^DIC(19,15338,1,2,0)="creating a quick order is similar to a dialog for entering an"
^DIC(19,15338,1,3,0)="order. The responses you enter will become the pre-defined responses"
^DIC(19,15338,1,4,0)="for this quick order. End users will have the opportunity to edit"
^DIC(19,15338,1,5,0)="these pre-defined responses, if desired."
