^DIC(19,15409,1,2,0)="configure how often the list rule should be ran and update the team list."
^DIC(19,15409,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(19,15409,1,4,0)="The tasked option, Update Team List From Reminder List Rule [ORLP TEAM"
^DIC(19,15409,1,5,0)="LIST FROM REM], will use these mappings and settings, to determine which"
^DIC(19,15409,1,6,0)="list rules should be ran and which team lists to update."
