^DIC(19,15657,1,1,0)="This menu allows patient orders to be reviewed."
^DIC(19,15657,1,2,0)=" "
^DIC(19,15657,1,3,0)="TECHNICAL NOTE:"
^DIC(19,15657,1,4,0)="This option is used to transfer control of menus and options used in"
^DIC(19,15657,1,5,0)="the OE/RR package to the Protocol file (101).  Items should NOT be"
^DIC(19,15657,1,6,0)="placed on this menu.  The counterpart of this menu in file 101 is"
^DIC(19,15657,1,7,0)="ORREV where menu items used with OE/RR are placed."
