^DIC(19,15876,1,1,0)="This menu contains all of the options needed to manage the electronic "
^DIC(19,15876,1,2,0)="Prescribing of Controlled Substances (ePCS) functionality in CPRS."
^DIC(19,15876,1,3,0)="Cloned from ""OR EPCS MENU"" option."
