^DIC(19,16091,1,3,0)="Selection Items and Header names) for components of the Ad Hoc Health"
^DIC(19,16091,1,4,0)="Summary Type. Components can also be deleted from this option."
^DIC(19,16091,1,5,0)="Cloned from ""GMTS IRM/ADPAC ADHOC EDIT"" option."
