^DIC(19,16115,1,0)="^^6^6^3240328^"
^DIC(19,16115,1,1,0)="This option is used by individuals who have the capability to build their "
^DIC(19,16115,1,2,0)="own Health Summary Types. It has all of the capabilities of the 'Health"
^DIC(19,16115,1,3,0)="Summary Users Menu' with the addition of the 'Build Health Summary Type"
