^DIC(19,16133,1,1,0)="This option allows the user to create or modify a Health "
^DIC(19,16133,1,2,0)="Summary Object.  Objects are Health Summaries that may have "
^DIC(19,16133,1,3,0)="their headers suppressed so they may be inserted into another"
