^DIC(19,16178,1,1,0)="This allows the user to display the current definition of a Health Summary"
^DIC(19,16178,1,2,0)="Type.  The display includes the sequence of components, and occurrence and"
^DIC(19,16178,1,3,0)="time limits and selection items when they apply to a component."
^DIC(19,16178,1,4,0)="Cloned from ""GMTS TYPE INQ"" option."
