^DIC(19,16186,0)="EHM-01007^Display 'Health Summary Types List' Defaults^^R^1^^^^^^^^^^^"
^DIC(19,16186,1,0)="^19.06^6^6^3240328^^^^"
^DIC(19,16186,1,1,0)="Use this option to display the list of Health Summary Types that "
^DIC(19,16186,1,2,0)="will be contained in the 'Health Summary Types' section on the "
^DIC(19,16186,1,3,0)="Reports Tab in CPRS.  The display includes the precedence of "
^DIC(19,16186,1,4,0)="parameters, the method for building the list, and finally the list"
^DIC(19,16186,1,5,0)="that will actually appear on the Reports Tab in CPRS."
