^DIC(19,16213,1,0)="^19.06^4^4^3240328^^"
^DIC(19,16213,1,1,0)="This option is used to delete a Health Summary Object that"
^DIC(19,16213,1,2,0)="you created.  You may not delete Health Summary Objects "
^DIC(19,16213,1,3,0)="created by other people."
