^DIC(19,16504,1,0)="^19.06^5^5^3240328^^^"
^DIC(19,16504,1,1,0)="This option allows a user to modify the ""Mental Health Active"" CPRS"
^DIC(19,16504,1,2,0)="parameter.  You can activate mental health dialogs for reminder resolution"
^DIC(19,16504,1,3,0)="processing at a user, service, division, or system level. When activated"
^DIC(19,16504,1,4,0)="for a level, mental health tests in a reminder dialog can be performed."
