^DIC(19,16570,1,4,0)="The Health Summary package contains a new PCE component that displays the"
^DIC(19,16570,1,5,0)="directions entered through this option."
^DIC(19,16570,1,6,0)="Cloned from ""PX EDIT LOCATION OF HOME"" option."
