^DIC(19,16590,1,1,0)="This utility will allow the user's to clean up Encounters that point to a "
^DIC(19,16590,1,2,0)="Visit that does not exist. User will then be able to run the Check Out"
^DIC(19,16590,1,3,0)="process without problems."
