^DIC(19,16596,"U")="CREATE PROBLEM SELECTION LISTS"
^DIC(19,16597,0)="EHM-01418^Build Problem Selection List(s)^^R^1^^^^^^^402^^^^"
^DIC(19,16597,1,0)="^^6^6^3240328^^^^"
^DIC(19,16597,1,1,0)="This option allows access to utilities to facilitate the creation"
^DIC(19,16597,1,2,0)="and maintenance of problem menus, i.e. lists of commonly selected"
^DIC(19,16597,1,3,0)="problems.  Categories of problems may be defined, and lists created"
^DIC(19,16597,1,4,0)="from linking categories together; categories may be reused in multiple"
^DIC(19,16597,1,5,0)="lists."
^DIC(19,16597,1,6,0)="Cloned from ""GMPL BUILD SELECTION LIST"" option."
^DIC(19,16597,3)=""
^DIC(19,16597,25)="EN^GMPLBLD"
^DIC(19,16597,"U")="BUILD PROBLEM SELECTION LIST(S"
^DIC(19,16598,0)="EHM-01419^Assign/Remove Problem Selection List^^R^1^^^^^^^402^^^^"
^DIC(19,16598,1,0)="^^11^11^3240328^"
^DIC(19,16598,1,1,0)="This option allows a selection list to be assigned to user(s) as his/her"
^DIC(19,16598,1,2,0)="preferred menu of problems to select from and/or to a clinic location as "
^DIC(19,16598,1,3,0)="its default list. A user's assignment will override a clinic assignment."
^DIC(19,16598,1,4,0)=" "
^DIC(19,16598,1,5,0)="If a list is specified for the user in the Default Problem Selection List "
^DIC(19,16598,1,6,0)="Display [ORQQPL SELECTION LIST] parameter, then the Add New Problem(s)"
^DIC(19,16598,1,7,0)="option will present this list of problems to select from. If there are no "
^DIC(19,16598,1,8,0)="user defined lists, then a default clinic list will be presented."
^DIC(19,16598,1,9,0)="Searching the Lexicon Utility for a problem not on this list is always an"
^DIC(19,16598,1,10,0)="option from these menus as well."
^DIC(19,16598,1,11,0)="Cloned from ""GMPL ASSIGN LIST"" option."
^DIC(19,16598,3)=""
^DIC(19,16598,20)=""
^DIC(19,16598,25)="ASSIGN^GMPLBLD2"
^DIC(19,16598,"U")="ASSIGN/REMOVE PROBLEM SELECTIO"
^DIC(19,16599,0)="EHM-01420^Copy Selection List from IB Encounter Form^This option has been disabled due to the Problem List SNOMED CT implementation.^R^1^^^^^^^402^^^^"
^DIC(19,16599,1,0)="^^7^7^3240328^^"
^DIC(19,16599,1,1,0)="This option will allow creating a new selection list by copying a list"
^DIC(19,16599,1,2,0)="already created through the Encounter Form utility (Integrated Billing"
^DIC(19,16599,1,3,0)="package) into a new entry in file #125.  This list will then be available"
^DIC(19,16599,1,4,0)="for editing further (only the new list will be altered - the list saved"
^DIC(19,16599,1,5,0)="in the Integrated Billing pkg with the form will not be changed here),"
^DIC(19,16599,1,6,0)="or for use to select from when entering new problems to a patient's list."
^DIC(19,16599,1,7,0)="Cloned from ""GMPL BUILD ENC FORM LIST"" option."
^DIC(19,16599,3)=""
^DIC(19,16599,25)="GMPLBLDF"
^DIC(19,16599,"U")="COPY SELECTION LIST FROM IB EN"
^DIC(19,16600,0)="EHM-01421^Delete Problem Selection List^^R^1^^^^^^^402^^^^"
^DIC(19,16600,1,0)="^^5^5^3240328^"
^DIC(19,16600,1,1,0)="This option will allow the user to delete a problem selection list and"
^DIC(19,16600,1,2,0)="its contents that is no longer in use.  Once a list is selected, the"
^DIC(19,16600,1,3,0)="New Person file, ""Problem Selection List"" field, for pointers to the"
^DIC(19,16600,1,4,0)="chosen list; if any users are found, deleting the list is not permitted."
^DIC(19,16600,1,5,0)="Cloned from ""GMPL DELETE LIST"" option."
^DIC(19,16600,3)=""
^DIC(19,16600,25)="DELETE^GMPLBLD3"
^DIC(19,16600,"U")="DELETE PROBLEM SELECTION LIST"
^DIC(19,16601,0)="EHM-01422^Check Problem Selection List Problem Codes^^R^1^^^^^^^402^^^^"
^DIC(19,16601,1,0)="^^6^6^3240328^"
^DIC(19,16601,1,1,0)="This option will produce a report related to Problem Selection Lists. The"
^DIC(19,16601,1,2,0)="report will contain a list of any Problem Selection Lists that contain "
^DIC(19,16601,1,3,0)="problems with inactive SNOMED and/or ICD codes attached. It will also"
^DIC(19,16601,1,4,0)="determine if any attached ICD codes are due to be inactivated in the"
^DIC(19,16601,1,5,0)="future and a report of those findings is also included."
^DIC(19,16601,1,6,0)="Cloned from ""GMPL SELECTION LIST CSV CHECK"" option."
^DIC(19,16601,3)=""
^DIC(19,16601,25)="CSVOPT^GMPLBLCK"
^DIC(19,16601,"U")="CHECK PROBLEM SELECTION LIST P"
^DIC(19,16602,0)="EHM-01423^Import Problem Selection List^^R^1^^^^^^^402^^^^"
^DIC(19,16602,1,0)="^^4^4^3240328^"
^DIC(19,16602,1,1,0)="This option allows users to import National Problem Selection List "
^DIC(19,16602,1,2,0)="content to the VistA system using two import methods: 1) CSV host file or "
^DIC(19,16602,1,3,0)="2) CSV file from a web site."
^DIC(19,16602,1,4,0)="Cloned from ""GMPL SELECTION LIST IMPORT"" option."
^DIC(19,16602,3)=""
^DIC(19,16602,25)="IMP^GMPLSLI1"
^DIC(19,16602,"U")="IMPORT PROBLEM SELECTION LIST"
^DIC(19,16603,0)="EHM-01424^Replace Removed Problem(s) on Patient's List^^R^1^^^^^^^402^^^^"
^DIC(19,16603,1,0)="^^4^4^3240328^"
^DIC(19,16603,1,1,0)="This option will allow the user to list all of the problems that have"
^DIC(19,16603,1,2,0)="been removed from a selected patient's problem list, and optionally"
^DIC(19,16603,1,3,0)="place any of them back on the problem list."
^DIC(19,16603,1,4,0)="Cloned from ""GMPL REPLACE PROBLEMS"" option."
^DIC(19,16603,3)=""
^DIC(19,16603,25)="EN^GMPLRPTR"
^DIC(19,16603,"U")="REPLACE REMOVED PROBLEM(S) ON "
^DIC(19,16604,0)="EHM-01425^Problem List NTRT Follow-up Report^^A^1^^^^^^^402^^1^^"
^DIC(19,16604,1,0)="^^6^6^3240328^"
^DIC(19,16604,1,1,0)="This report allows sites to evaluate problems with valid SNOMED CT Concept"
^DIC(19,16604,1,2,0)="codes, which were unmapped to ICD at the time of entry."
^DIC(19,16604,1,3,0)=" "
^DIC(19,16604,1,4,0)="The report may be filtered by Medical Center Division, Provider(s), and "
^DIC(19,16604,1,5,0)="Time Interval."
^DIC(19,16604,1,6,0)="Cloned from ""GMPL NTRT F/U RPT"" option."
^DIC(19,16604,3)=""
^DIC(19,16604,20)="D MAIN^GMPLNTRT"
^DIC(19,16604,"U")="PROBLEM LIST NTRT FOLLOW-UP RE"
^DIC(19,16605,0)="EHM-01426^Problem List Freetext Follow-up Report^^A^1^^^^^^^402^^1^^"
^DIC(19,16605,1,0)="^^3^3^3240328^"
^DIC(19,16605,1,1,0)="This report allows sites to evaluate uncoded freetext problems that have"
^DIC(19,16605,1,2,0)="been entered by one or more providers over a specified time interval."
^DIC(19,16605,1,3,0)="Cloned from ""GMPL FREETEXT F/U REPORT"" option."
^DIC(19,16605,3)=""
^DIC(19,16605,20)="D MAIN^GMPLNTFT"
^DIC(19,16605,"U")="PROBLEM LIST FREETEXT FOLLOW-U"
^DIC(19,16606,0)="EHM-01427^SNOMED in Diagnosis Field Error Report^^A^1^^^^^^^402^^1^^"
^DIC(19,16606,1,0)="^19.06^4^4^3240328^^"
^DIC(19,16606,1,1,0)="This report allows sites to evaluate and review erroneous problems found "
^DIC(19,16606,1,2,0)="in the Problem file that have a SNOMED CT concept code stored in the"
^DIC(19,16606,1,3,0)="Diagnosis field."
^DIC(19,16606,1,4,0)="Cloned from ""GMPL DIAG ERROR REPORT"" option."
^DIC(19,16606,3)=""
^DIC(19,16606,20)="D VWERRPT^GMPLCLN"
^DIC(19,16606,"U")="SNOMED IN DIAGNOSIS FIELD ERRO"
^DIC(19,16607,0)="EHM-01428^SNOMED in Diagnosis Field Cleanup Report^^A^1^^^^^^^402^^1^^"
^DIC(19,16607,1,0)="^19.06^5^5^3240328^^"
^DIC(19,16607,1,1,0)="This report allows sites to review a list of records that have been "
^DIC(19,16607,1,2,0)="corrected and cleaned up by patch GMPL*2.0*40 or as a result of running "
^DIC(19,16607,1,3,0)="the Generate SNOMED in Diagnosis Field Err/Cleanup Rpt [GMPL GENERATE "
^DIC(19,16607,1,4,0)="DIAG RPTS] menu option."
^DIC(19,16607,1,5,0)="Cloned from ""GMPL DIAG CLEANUP REPORT"" option."
^DIC(19,16607,3)=""
^DIC(19,16607,20)="D VWCLRPT^GMPLCLN"
^DIC(19,16607,"U")="SNOMED IN DIAGNOSIS FIELD CLEA"
^DIC(19,16608,0)="EHM-01429^Generate SNOMED in Diagnosis Field Err/Cleanup Rpt^^A^1^^^^^^^402^^1^^"
^DIC(19,16608,1,0)="^^6^6^3240328^"
^DIC(19,16608,1,1,0)="This option allows sites to run a scan of the Problem file for errors "
^DIC(19,16608,1,2,0)="whereby the SNOMED CT concept code is incorrectly stored in the Diagnosis "
^DIC(19,16608,1,3,0)="field. If errors are found, a cleanup of the Problem file is performed and"
^DIC(19,16608,1,4,0)="two separate Mailman messages will be sent to the installer containing "
^DIC(19,16608,1,5,0)="instructions on how to access the error and cleanup reports."
^DIC(19,16608,1,6,0)="Cloned from ""GMPL GENERATE DIAG RPTS"" option."
^DIC(19,16608,3)=""
^DIC(19,16608,20)="D EN^GMPLCLNP"
^DIC(19,16608,"U")="GENERATE SNOMED IN DIAGNOSIS F"
