^DIC(19,16918,1,1,0)="This option allows CACs to map ALL local titles to the VHA Enterprise"
^DIC(19,16918,1,2,0)="Standard Document Title Ontology, by iterating through all of the ACTIVE "
^DIC(19,16918,1,3,0)="titles defined for the station. This is a necessary prerequisite to"
^DIC(19,16918,1,4,0)="migrating document management to the HDR."
^DIC(19,16918,1,5,0)="Cloned from ""TIU MAP ACTIVE LOCAL TITLES"" option."
