^DIC(19,16919,1,2,0)="Standard Document Title Ontology, by selecting the ACTIVE title in"
^DIC(19,16919,1,3,0)="question. The user may also select a previously mapped title, and re-map "
^DIC(19,16919,1,4,0)="it, if necessary."
