^DIC(19,16946,1,0)="^19.06^5^5^3240328^^^^"
^DIC(19,16946,1,1,0)="This option allows the user to assign to user or delete from a user"
^DIC(19,16946,1,2,0)="a file range.  This range is used when creating a new file.   If the"
^DIC(19,16946,1,3,0)="range is present, then the user can only create new files whose numbers"
^DIC(19,16946,1,4,0)="are within the range."
^DIC(19,16946,1,5,0)="Cloned from ""XUFILERANGEASSIGN"" option."
