^DIC(19,16971,1,1,0)="Use this option to reactivate a user who has a"
^DIC(19,16971,1,2,0)="TERMINATION DATE.  You will be asked to enter his ACCESS CODE.  If you"
^DIC(19,16971,1,3,0)="give him an access code (or if he still has one), his TERMINATION DATE"
