^DIC(19,16980,1,1,0)="This option is used to give one or more users access to selected files."
^DIC(19,16980,1,2,0)="You may enter an individual file number, a range of numbers, and/or a"
^DIC(19,16980,1,3,0)="list of file numbers.  Remember, you can only give out access to files"
^DIC(19,16980,1,4,0)="to which you have access."
^DIC(19,16980,1,5,0)="Cloned from ""XUFILEGRANT"" option."
