^DIC(19,17054,1,1,0)="This option will provide a summary report of appointments that have an "
^DIC(19,17054,1,2,0)="appointment date after the Oracle Health conversion date and entered in "
^DIC(19,17054,1,3,0)="VistA after the Oracle Health conversion date."
^DIC(19,17054,1,4,0)=" "
^DIC(19,17054,1,5,0)="The report excludes clinics added in the active clinic add/edit option."
^DIC(19,17054,1,6,0)=" "
^DIC(19,17054,1,7,0)="This report can be run pre-conversion and post-conversion to Oracle "
